WEBVTT

00:31.990 --> 00:35.410
(Star wars
main theme music playing)

03:06.770 --> 03:09.606
- (Beeping, chirping)
- Lock onto him, R2.

03:09.690 --> 03:10.691
(Beeps)

03:10.774 --> 03:13.151
Master, general grievous's ship
is directly ahead

03:13.235 --> 03:15.487
the one crawling with vulture droids.

03:15.570 --> 03:18.115
Oh, I see it.
Oh, this is going to be easy.

03:18.198 --> 03:21.410
(Speaking droid language)

03:25.747 --> 03:28.333
- Oddball, do you copy?
- Man: (On headset) Copy, red leader.

03:28.417 --> 03:30.711
Mark my position.
Form your squad up behind me.

03:30.794 --> 03:32.713
We're on your tail, general Kenobi.

03:32.796 --> 03:34.756
Set s-foils in attack position.

03:48.645 --> 03:50.689
This is where the fun begins.

03:50.772 --> 03:52.816
Let them pass between us.

04:09.541 --> 04:13.503
- They're all over me. Get them off my...
- (Static scratching)

04:13.587 --> 04:15.505
- I'm gonna go help them out.
- Obl-wan: No.

04:15.589 --> 04:18.341
No, they are doing their job
so we can do ours.

04:21.011 --> 04:22.220
(Screams)

04:26.057 --> 04:29.311
(Speaking droid language)

04:32.272 --> 04:34.858
Missiles. Pull up.

04:36.276 --> 04:38.862
- They overshot us.
- They're coming around.

04:43.200 --> 04:46.036
- (Beeping)
- All right, R4.

04:46.119 --> 04:48.705
No, no, no, no. No, nothing too fancy.

04:51.917 --> 04:55.670
Surge all power units, R2.
Stand by reverse thrusters.

04:55.754 --> 04:58.215
- (Engines roaring)
- (Whistling)

05:03.470 --> 05:07.057
- (Chuckles) We got 'em, R2.
- (Beeps, whistles)

05:15.357 --> 05:17.400
Flying is for droids.

05:24.574 --> 05:28.411
- I'm hit. Anakin?
- I see them. Buzz droids.

05:28.495 --> 05:31.164
- (Cackling)
- (R4 whimpering)

05:31.248 --> 05:34.709
- (Squawking)
- (Chirping)

05:36.002 --> 05:38.046
R4, be careful. You have a...

05:40.298 --> 05:43.093
- (Wailing)
- Oh, dear.

05:45.220 --> 05:47.055
They're shutting down all the controls.

05:47.138 --> 05:49.158
Move to the right
so I can get a clear shot at them.

05:49.182 --> 05:50.183
The mission.

05:50.267 --> 05:52.727
Get to the command ship.
Get the chancellor.

05:52.811 --> 05:54.145
I'm running out of tricks here.

05:57.023 --> 06:01.319
- (Squealing)
- Oh! In the name of...

06:03.613 --> 06:06.074
Hold your fire! You're not helping here.

06:06.157 --> 06:07.617
I agree. Bad idea.

06:10.745 --> 06:12.455
(Screams)

06:13.999 --> 06:16.793
I can't see a thing.
My cockpit's fogging.

06:20.046 --> 06:21.965
They're all over me. Anakin!

06:24.968 --> 06:26.595
Move to the right.

06:26.678 --> 06:28.680
Hold on, Anakin.
You're gonna get us both killed.

06:31.182 --> 06:33.143
Get out of here.
There's nothing more you can do.

06:33.226 --> 06:35.437
I'm not leaving without you, master.

06:38.982 --> 06:42.277
(Buzzing)

06:44.404 --> 06:47.240
- (Beeping, whistling)
- Get him, R2.

06:47.324 --> 06:50.702
- (Buzz droid squawks)
- Watch out.

06:50.785 --> 06:52.996
(Whistles)

06:55.290 --> 06:57.626
R2, hit the buzz droid's center eye.

06:57.709 --> 06:59.502
(Beeping)

07:04.841 --> 07:07.177
- Yeah, you got him!
- Great, R2.

07:09.471 --> 07:11.389
The general's command ship
is dead ahead.

07:11.473 --> 07:13.391
(R2-d2 squealing)

07:13.475 --> 07:15.560
Well, have you noticed
the shields are still up?

07:16.019 --> 07:17.687
Sorry, master.

07:25.195 --> 07:27.322
Oh, I have a bad feeling about this.

07:42.128 --> 07:44.297
There they are. Get them.

07:53.682 --> 07:57.811
- (Beeping, whistling)
- R2, locate the chancellor.

07:57.894 --> 08:00.021
(Chirps)

08:00.105 --> 08:02.065
(Groaning)

08:04.609 --> 08:06.111
(Whistles)

08:06.194 --> 08:08.905
Obi-Wan: The chancellor's signal
is coming from right there,

08:08.989 --> 08:12.075
the observation platform
at the top of that spire.

08:12.158 --> 08:14.119
I sense count dooku.

08:14.202 --> 08:17.497
- I sense a trap.
- Next move?

08:17.580 --> 08:21.167
- Spring the trap.
- (Whistling)

08:22.127 --> 08:24.462
R2, go back.
I need you to stay with the ship.

08:24.546 --> 08:26.464
Here. Take this and wait for orders.

08:26.548 --> 08:28.466
(Beeping)

08:31.761 --> 08:33.680
(G rowls)

08:33.763 --> 08:36.391
(Coughing)

08:40.770 --> 08:44.274
What's the situation, captain?

08:44.357 --> 08:48.319
Two jedi have landed in the main
hangar bay. We're tracking them.

08:48.403 --> 08:52.699
Just as count dooku predicted. (Coughs)

08:52.782 --> 08:56.036
(Cackles)

08:56.119 --> 08:57.954
- (Clattering)
- Destroyers.

09:06.129 --> 09:09.007
Battle droid: Drop your weapons.
I said drop 'em.

09:09.090 --> 09:10.592
Roger. Roger, Roger.

09:10.675 --> 09:11.885
Roger, Roger.

09:11.968 --> 09:13.636
(All groaning)

09:16.639 --> 09:18.308
(Beeps)

09:19.517 --> 09:21.436
Those are jedi fighters all right.

09:21.519 --> 09:24.314
(Beeps softly)

09:26.608 --> 09:28.610
- Did you press the stop button?
- No. Did you?

09:29.778 --> 09:31.498
Well, there's more than one way
out of here.

09:31.529 --> 09:33.364
Obi-Wan: We don't want to get out.

09:33.448 --> 09:39.162
We want to get moving.
R2, activate elevator 31174.

09:39.245 --> 09:41.456
- Obi-Wan: (On comlink) Come in, R2.
- What that?

09:41.539 --> 09:43.458
- R2, do you copy?
- (Electronic twittering)

09:43.541 --> 09:45.460
R2, activate the elevator number...

09:45.543 --> 09:47.796
- (Muffled) 31174.
- (Chirps softly)

09:47.879 --> 09:50.840
Get back to work. That nothin'.

09:50.924 --> 09:53.885
Obi-Wan: (Muffled)
Activate the elevator 31174.

09:53.968 --> 09:55.887
R2, we...

10:01.017 --> 10:03.603
(Sighs) Always on the move.

10:03.686 --> 10:05.605
Obi-Wan: (Muffled)
R2, switch on the com/ink.

10:05.688 --> 10:07.732
R2, can you hear me?

10:07.816 --> 10:10.276
- R2?
- (R2-d2 beeps)

10:10.360 --> 10:11.653
Whoa!

10:11.736 --> 10:13.863
Obi-Wan: (Fading) R2! R2!

10:15.198 --> 10:17.242
(Beeping)

10:17.325 --> 10:20.703
Stop. Stop. R2, we need to be going up.

10:23.123 --> 10:25.041
Hands up, jedi.

10:25.125 --> 10:27.335
Obi-Wan: (On comlink) R2, do you copy?

10:27.418 --> 10:31.422
R2, do you hear me?
R2, we need to be going up, not down.

10:32.590 --> 10:33.591
(O roans)

10:34.634 --> 10:36.177
(Chirps)

10:36.261 --> 10:39.264
- Hey, you!
- (Beeping)

10:42.433 --> 10:44.352
Now, that's better.

10:44.435 --> 10:48.731
- (Beeps, chirps)
- You stupid little astro droid.

10:49.649 --> 10:51.943
- Uh-oh.
- (Grunts)

10:58.908 --> 11:00.827
Oh, it's you.

11:00.910 --> 11:02.871
- (Beeping)
- (Groans)

11:02.954 --> 11:04.789
My eyes! My eyes!

11:04.873 --> 11:07.792
What was that all about?
Well, R2 has been...

11:07.876 --> 11:10.378
- Uh, no loose wire jokes.
- Did I say anything?

11:10.461 --> 11:12.422
- He's trying.
- I didn't say anything.

11:12.505 --> 11:14.716
(Beeping)

11:18.428 --> 11:20.638
(Chirps)

11:50.043 --> 11:51.961
- Chancellor.
- Are you all right?

11:52.045 --> 11:54.672
Count dooku.

11:58.259 --> 12:00.386
This time we will do it together.

12:00.470 --> 12:02.138
I was about to say that.

12:11.064 --> 12:14.275
Get help. You're no match for him.
He's a sith lord.

12:15.109 --> 12:18.446
Chancellor palpatine,
sith lords are our speciality.

12:18.529 --> 12:21.449
Your swords, please.

12:21.532 --> 12:25.036
We don't want to make a mess of things
in front of the chancellor.

12:25.119 --> 12:27.372
You won't get away this time, dooku.

12:38.299 --> 12:40.301
I've been looking fonnard to this.

12:40.385 --> 12:43.596
My powers have doubled
since the last time we met, count.

12:43.680 --> 12:47.183
Good. Twice the pride, double the fall.

12:53.398 --> 12:54.691
(O roans)

13:07.245 --> 13:08.246
Get...

13:09.205 --> 13:11.082
(O roans)

13:24.762 --> 13:27.265
(Grunts)

13:33.479 --> 13:38.568
I sense great fear in you, Skywalker.

13:38.651 --> 13:42.322
You have hate. You have anger.

13:42.405 --> 13:44.365
But you don't use them.

13:59.088 --> 14:01.257
(O roans)

14:03.968 --> 14:07.764
Good, Anakin. Good. (Chuckling)

14:07.847 --> 14:09.891
Kill him.

14:11.351 --> 14:12.935
Kill him now.

14:18.566 --> 14:20.485
I shouldn't.

14:23.321 --> 14:24.447
Do it.

14:36.459 --> 14:39.379
You did well, Anakin.

14:39.462 --> 14:43.424
He was too dangerous to be kept alive.

14:44.384 --> 14:45.927
Yes, but he was an unarmed prisoner.

14:46.010 --> 14:48.888
I shouldn't have done that.
It's not the jedi way.

14:48.971 --> 14:54.143
It is only natural. He cut off your arm,
and you wanted revenge.

14:54.227 --> 14:57.271
It wasn't the first time, Anakin.

14:57.355 --> 15:01.150
Remember what you told me
about your mother and the sand people?

15:01.234 --> 15:03.820
(Sand people shouting faintly)

15:03.903 --> 15:07.532
Now we must leave
before more security droids arrive.

15:12.495 --> 15:14.914
Anakin, there's no time.

15:14.997 --> 15:18.251
We must get off this ship
before it's too late.

15:18.334 --> 15:22.380
- He seems to be all right.
- Leave him, or we'll never make it.

15:22.463 --> 15:25.174
His fate will be the same as ours.

15:29.595 --> 15:31.806
Prepare for attack!

15:34.100 --> 15:36.018
All batteries, fire! Fire!

15:43.067 --> 15:44.652
(Screams)

15:46.028 --> 15:47.989
Elevator's not working.

15:51.701 --> 15:54.370
R2, activate elevator 3224.

15:54.454 --> 15:57.248
(Whistling, beeping)

16:03.087 --> 16:04.088
(O roans)

16:06.841 --> 16:09.260
(Beeping)

16:10.970 --> 16:12.972
(Screaming)

16:13.055 --> 16:16.309
- Reverse stabilizers.
- Reversing stabilizers.

16:16.392 --> 16:19.770
(Beeping)

16:30.698 --> 16:32.241
(Squealing)

16:35.578 --> 16:37.747
Magnetize! Magnetize!

16:40.124 --> 16:42.084
(Squealing, beeping)

16:44.295 --> 16:47.632
Fire the emergency booster engines.

16:52.637 --> 16:54.555
We're leveling out, sir.

16:57.683 --> 17:00.144
Oh!

17:07.652 --> 17:10.196
(Gasps)

17:10.279 --> 17:12.490
Anakin: Easy.
We're in a bit of a situation here.

17:12.573 --> 17:15.201
- Did I miss something?
- Hold on.

17:15.284 --> 17:17.495
- What is that?
- Anakin: Uh, oops.

17:17.578 --> 17:19.580
R2. R2, shut down the elevator.

17:19.664 --> 17:21.624
Too late. Jump!

17:28.089 --> 17:29.131
(Shouts)

17:32.468 --> 17:33.636
(All groan)

17:35.221 --> 17:36.901
Obi-Wan: Let's see
if we can find something

17:36.973 --> 17:38.891
in the hangar bay that's still flyable.

17:38.975 --> 17:41.060
- R2, get down here.
- (Groans)

17:41.143 --> 17:43.437
Anakin: (On comlink) R2, do you copy?

17:43.521 --> 17:47.275
(Chirps, whistles)

17:47.358 --> 17:50.111
(Wheezing, coughing)
General, we found the jedi.

17:50.194 --> 17:52.196
They're in hallway 328.

17:52.280 --> 17:54.657
Activate ray shields.

17:56.993 --> 17:58.911
Ray shields.

17:58.995 --> 18:00.395
Wait a minute. How did this happen?

18:00.454 --> 18:02.123
We're smarter than this.

18:02.206 --> 18:03.207
Apparently not.

18:05.334 --> 18:08.546
- I say Patience.
- Patience?

18:08.629 --> 18:11.924
Yes. R2 will be along in a few moments,

18:12.008 --> 18:15.303
and then he'll release the ray shields.

18:15.386 --> 18:17.305
(Door opens)

18:17.388 --> 18:19.765
(Squealing)

18:19.849 --> 18:21.809
(Sputters, squeaks)

18:21.892 --> 18:24.145
See? No problem.

18:24.228 --> 18:26.397
(Speaking droid language)

18:26.480 --> 18:28.107
- Don't move.
- (Beeps)

18:31.444 --> 18:34.071
Do you have a plan b?

18:39.994 --> 18:44.582
Ah, yes. The negotiator.

18:44.665 --> 18:48.919
General Kenobi.
We've been waiting for you.

18:49.003 --> 18:51.172
Battle droid: Excuse me.

18:51.255 --> 18:52.882
That wasn't much of a rescue.

18:52.965 --> 18:54.050
You're welcome.

18:54.133 --> 18:56.594
And... (Coughs)

18:56.677 --> 18:59.472
Anakin Skywalker.

18:59.555 --> 19:05.311
I was expecting someone with
your reputation to be a little older.

19:05.394 --> 19:07.313
(Wheezes)

19:07.396 --> 19:11.692
General grievous.
You're shorter than I expected.

19:11.776 --> 19:16.322
(Coughing) Jedi scum.

19:16.405 --> 19:19.200
We have a job to do, Anakin.
Try not to upset him.

19:19.283 --> 19:21.911
(Beeps, chirps)

19:21.994 --> 19:23.371
(Coughs)

19:23.454 --> 19:28.668
Your lightsabers will make
a fine addition to my collection.

19:28.751 --> 19:32.463
Not this time.
And this time, you won't escape.

19:34.882 --> 19:36.384
(Squeals)

19:38.552 --> 19:41.263
- Crush them!
- (Alarm blaring)

19:41.347 --> 19:43.432
Make them suffer!

19:47.436 --> 19:49.146
Come. Now!

19:49.230 --> 19:51.440
- Stay at your stations!
- Whoa!

19:53.401 --> 19:55.277
(Rapid beeping)

19:58.072 --> 20:00.616
Get him! Get him!

20:02.993 --> 20:04.954
Battle droid: Ow!

20:10.000 --> 20:11.001
(Screams)

20:18.926 --> 20:20.845
Run!

20:20.928 --> 20:24.306
- (Groaning)
- (Sighs)

20:24.390 --> 20:26.308
Don't bother with them.

20:26.392 --> 20:27.994
- Keep the ship in orbit.
- Battle droid: Yes, sir.

20:28.018 --> 20:31.021
-(Whimpering) (Shouts)

20:31.105 --> 20:32.273
(Squeaks, beeps)

20:38.946 --> 20:41.657
You lose, general Kenobi.

20:55.504 --> 20:57.673
(Gasping)

21:05.473 --> 21:07.558
Get out of here! Run!

21:18.277 --> 21:20.613
(Cackles)

21:20.696 --> 21:23.199
Time to abandon ship.

21:27.828 --> 21:30.331
(Cackles, coughs)

21:30.414 --> 21:32.833
- (Alarm beeping)
- All the escape pods have been launched.

21:32.917 --> 21:36.003
Obi-Wan: Grievous.
Can you fly a cruiser like this?

21:36.086 --> 21:38.064
You mean, do I know how to land
what's left of this thing?

21:38.088 --> 21:39.131
Well?

21:39.215 --> 21:40.275
Well, under the circumstances,

21:40.299 --> 21:42.802
I'd say the ability
to pilot this thing is irrelevant.

21:42.885 --> 21:44.094
Strap yourselves in.

21:45.846 --> 21:48.724
Open all hatches.
Extend all flaps and drag fins.

21:51.644 --> 21:53.687
(Squeaking, whistling)

22:03.322 --> 22:07.618
- (Beeps "uh-oh")
- We lost something.

22:07.701 --> 22:10.204
Not to worry.
We are still flying half a ship.

22:13.457 --> 22:17.461
- (Beeping)
- Now we're really picking up speed.

22:26.095 --> 22:27.888
Obi-Wan: Eight plus 60.

22:27.972 --> 22:29.932
We're in the atmosphere.

22:30.015 --> 22:32.059
Grab that. Keep us level.

22:37.064 --> 22:39.608
(Chirping, beeping)

22:45.197 --> 22:48.325
- Steady.
- (Beeping)

22:49.368 --> 22:51.078
Easy, R2.

22:54.248 --> 22:57.960
Five thousand. Fire ships
on the left and the right.

22:58.043 --> 23:00.796
- We'll take you in.
- Obi-Wan: Copy that.

23:03.173 --> 23:05.259
Landing strip, straight ahead.

23:05.342 --> 23:06.969
We're coming in too hot.

23:10.681 --> 23:13.350
(Chirping, whistling)

23:15.978 --> 23:17.187
(R2-d2 squealing)

23:19.565 --> 23:21.317
(Squealing continues)

23:33.787 --> 23:37.666
- (R2-d2 chirping)
- (Sighs)

23:38.542 --> 23:40.044
Another happy landing.

24:06.695 --> 24:10.157
(R2-d2 chirps)

24:10.240 --> 24:12.451
Are you coming, master?

24:12.534 --> 24:14.244
Oh, no.
I'm not brave enough for politics.

24:14.328 --> 24:16.246
I have to report to the council.

24:16.330 --> 24:18.791
Besides, someone needs
to be the poster boy.

24:18.874 --> 24:22.753
Hold on.
This whole operation was your idea.

24:22.836 --> 24:25.965
Let us not forget, Anakin, that
you rescued me from the buzz droids.

24:26.048 --> 24:28.509
And you killed count dooku,
and you rescued the chancellor,

24:28.592 --> 24:30.511
carrying me unconscious on your back.

24:30.594 --> 24:33.138
All because of your training.

24:33.222 --> 24:36.767
Anakin, let's be fair.
Today you were the hero,

24:36.850 --> 24:39.937
and you deserve your glorious day
with the politicians.

24:40.020 --> 24:44.108
All right. But you owe me one, and not
for saving your skin for the tenth time.

24:44.191 --> 24:48.445
Ninth time. That business on
cato neimoidia doesn't count.

24:48.529 --> 24:50.447
I'll see you at the briefing.

24:55.786 --> 24:58.330
Chancellor palpatine, are you all right?

24:58.414 --> 25:01.333
Yes. Thanks to your two jedi knights.

25:01.417 --> 25:02.960
They killed count dooku,

25:03.043 --> 25:06.130
but general grievous
has escaped once again.

25:06.213 --> 25:09.758
General grievous will run and hide,
as he always does. He's a coward.

25:09.842 --> 25:14.179
But with count dooku dead,
he is the leader of the droid army.

25:14.263 --> 25:16.890
And I assure you, the senate will vote

25:16.974 --> 25:20.019
to continue the war
as long as grievous is alive.

25:20.102 --> 25:24.189
Then the jedi council will make
finding grievous our highest priority.

25:25.607 --> 25:27.568
- Alien: Watch it.
- Jar jar: Excuse me.

25:27.651 --> 25:28.944
Come along, R2.

25:29.028 --> 25:30.654
The republic cannot praise you enough.

25:30.738 --> 25:32.865
Thank you, senator organa.

25:32.948 --> 25:33.949
(Beeping)

25:34.033 --> 25:36.535
Well, it couldn't possibly
be as bad as all that.

25:36.618 --> 25:38.579
- (Beeping)
- Now there I agree with you.

25:38.662 --> 25:40.956
In fact, I could do
with a tune-up myself.

25:41.040 --> 25:42.041
(Beeps)

25:42.124 --> 25:47.296
But the fighting will continue
until general grievous is spare parts.

25:47.379 --> 25:49.882
Organa: Well, I will do everything I can
in the senate.

25:49.965 --> 25:52.259
- Excuse me.
- Certainly.

25:52.342 --> 25:54.303
(Chirping)

25:59.683 --> 26:01.727
(Anakin sighs)

26:02.853 --> 26:04.813
Oh, Anakin.

26:06.065 --> 26:09.568
- (Sighs)
- I've missed you, Padmé.

26:10.736 --> 26:13.989
There were whispers
that you'd been killed.

26:14.073 --> 26:16.658
I'm all right.

26:16.742 --> 26:19.745
It feels like
we've been apart for a lifetime.

26:19.828 --> 26:22.623
And it might have been,
if the chancellor hadn't been kidnapped.

26:22.748 --> 26:23.892
I don't think they would have

26:23.916 --> 26:26.043
ever brought us back
from the outer rim sieges.

26:26.126 --> 26:28.879
- Wait. Not here.
- Yes, here.

26:28.962 --> 26:32.466
I'm tired of all this deception.
I don't care if they know we're married.

26:32.549 --> 26:34.843
Anakin, don't say things like that.

26:39.515 --> 26:41.683
(Sighs)

26:43.644 --> 26:47.272
Are you all right? You're trembling.

26:47.356 --> 26:49.525
What's going on?

26:51.568 --> 26:53.821
Something wonderful has happened.

26:55.823 --> 26:59.034
Ani, I'm pregnant.

27:02.996 --> 27:04.915
That's...

27:04.998 --> 27:06.917
(Sighs)

27:10.045 --> 27:12.631
(Stammering) Well, that's wonderful.

27:14.341 --> 27:17.386
What are we gonna do?

27:18.846 --> 27:22.266
We're not gonna worry about anything
right now. All right?

27:22.349 --> 27:24.852
This is a happy moment.

27:26.812 --> 27:29.148
The happiest moment of my life.

28:24.161 --> 28:28.373
(Wheezing)

28:31.335 --> 28:34.880
- (Coughs)
- (Beeping)

28:34.963 --> 28:38.133
Yes, lord Sidious?

28:38.217 --> 28:40.135
General grievous,

28:40.219 --> 28:45.349
I suggest you move
the separatist leaders to mustafar.

28:45.432 --> 28:49.311
It will be done, my lord.

28:49.394 --> 28:53.690
The end of the war is near, general.

28:53.774 --> 28:57.402
But the loss of count dooku...

28:57.486 --> 29:01.823
His death was a necessary loss.

29:01.907 --> 29:06.078
Soon I will have a new apprentice,

29:06.161 --> 29:11.458
one far younger and more powerful.

29:38.443 --> 29:41.488
Ani, I want to have our baby
back home on Naboo.

29:41.571 --> 29:44.950
We can go to the lake country
where no one will know,

29:45.033 --> 29:46.952
where we can be safe.

29:48.161 --> 29:51.498
I can go early
and fix up the baby's room.

29:53.500 --> 29:58.797
I know the perfect spot.
Right by the gardens.

30:03.051 --> 30:06.388
You are so beautiful.

30:07.973 --> 30:10.017
It's only because I'm so in love.

30:11.226 --> 30:12.561
No. (Chuckles)

30:12.644 --> 30:15.856
No, it's because
I'm so in love with you.

30:15.939 --> 30:19.526
- So love has blinded you?
- (Chuckles)

30:21.278 --> 30:23.363
Well, that's not exactly what I meant.

30:24.906 --> 30:26.992
But it's probably true.

30:27.534 --> 30:28.535
(Chuckles)

30:31.955 --> 30:34.458
(Baby crying)

30:34.541 --> 30:38.128
(Groans) Anakin, help me!

30:38.211 --> 30:40.130
(Sobs)

30:40.213 --> 30:43.050
(Screaming)

30:43.133 --> 30:46.386
- (Baby's cry fades)
- (Panting)

31:41.316 --> 31:43.276
What's bothering you?

31:45.654 --> 31:47.697
(Sighs) Nothing.

31:49.574 --> 31:51.952
I remember when I gave this to you.

31:52.035 --> 31:56.289
How long is it gonna take
for us to be honest with each other?

31:58.834 --> 32:00.752
It was a dream.

32:03.088 --> 32:05.549
Like the ones I used to have
about my mother,

32:05.632 --> 32:07.551
just before she died.

32:07.634 --> 32:09.553
And?

32:12.389 --> 32:14.349
And it was about you.

32:16.893 --> 32:18.854
Tell me.

32:20.564 --> 32:22.524
It was only a dream.

32:35.454 --> 32:37.414
You die in childbirth.

32:37.497 --> 32:40.292
And the baby?

32:40.375 --> 32:42.752
I don't know.

32:44.212 --> 32:46.131
It was only a dream.

32:46.214 --> 32:49.050
I won't let this one become real.

32:50.135 --> 32:52.804
This baby will change our lives.

32:52.888 --> 32:55.807
I doubt the queen will continue
to allow me to serve in the senate.

32:55.891 --> 32:58.643
And if the council discovers
you're the father, you'll be expelled...

32:58.727 --> 33:01.271
I know. I know.

33:01.354 --> 33:05.066
Do you think Obi-Wan
might be able to help us?

33:07.068 --> 33:09.112
We don't need his help.

33:10.405 --> 33:13.450
Our baby is a blessing.

33:29.633 --> 33:33.803
Premonitions? Premonitions. Hmm.

33:33.887 --> 33:37.057
These visions you have...

33:37.140 --> 33:40.769
They're of pain, suffering.

33:42.687 --> 33:44.606
Death.

33:44.689 --> 33:49.110
Yourself you speak of,
or someone you know?

33:50.570 --> 33:52.614
Someone.

33:52.697 --> 33:54.616
Close to you?

33:55.784 --> 33:58.036
Yes.

33:58.119 --> 34:01.998
Careful you must be
when sensing the future, Anakin.

34:02.082 --> 34:06.419
The fear of loss is
a path to the dark side.

34:08.630 --> 34:11.925
I won't let these visions
come true, master Yoda.

34:12.008 --> 34:15.220
Death is a natural part of life.

34:15.303 --> 34:20.016
Rejoice for those around you
who transform into the force.

34:20.100 --> 34:23.395
Mourn them, do not. Miss them, do not.

34:23.478 --> 34:26.606
Attachment leads to jealousy.

34:26.690 --> 34:30.151
The shadow of greed that is.

34:30.235 --> 34:33.071
What must I do, master Yoda?

34:33.154 --> 34:36.241
Train yourself to let go

34:36.324 --> 34:39.786
of everything you fear to lose.

34:50.171 --> 34:52.924
Obi-Wan: You've missed the report
on the outer rim sieges.

34:54.342 --> 34:56.761
I'm sorry. I was held up.

34:56.845 --> 35:00.432
I have no excuse.
In short, they are going very well.

35:00.515 --> 35:05.937
Saleucami has fallen, and master vos
has moved his troops to boz pity.

35:06.021 --> 35:08.064
What's wrong, then?

35:09.649 --> 35:10.775
The senate is expected

35:10.859 --> 35:14.362
to vote more executive powers
to the chancellor today.

35:14.446 --> 35:17.490
Well, that can only mean less
deliberating and more action.

35:17.574 --> 35:18.825
Is that bad?

35:18.908 --> 35:21.369
It'll make it easier for us
to end this war.

35:23.079 --> 35:25.415
Be careful of your friend palpatine.

35:27.042 --> 35:28.960
Be careful of what?

35:29.044 --> 35:31.713
- He has requested your presence.
- What for?

35:31.796 --> 35:36.468
He would not say.
He didn't inform the council?

35:36.551 --> 35:40.013
That's unusual, isn't it?
All of this is unusual.

35:40.096 --> 35:42.557
And it's making me feel uneasy.

35:57.530 --> 35:59.449
I hope you trust me, Anakin.

36:00.700 --> 36:01.701
Of course.

36:02.827 --> 36:04.746
I need your help, son.

36:05.872 --> 36:07.916
What do you mean?

36:07.999 --> 36:11.211
I'm depending on you.

36:11.294 --> 36:13.213
For what? I don't understand.

36:13.296 --> 36:18.885
To be the eyes, ears
and voice of the republic.

36:18.968 --> 36:21.137
Anakin,

36:21.221 --> 36:25.392
I'm appointing you to be my personal
representative on the jedi council.

36:25.475 --> 36:28.770
Me? A master?

36:30.355 --> 36:32.273
I'm ovennhelmed, sir.

36:34.150 --> 36:37.278
But the council elects its own members.
They'll never accept this.

36:37.362 --> 36:40.865
I think they will. They need you.

36:40.949 --> 36:43.410
More than you know.

36:54.087 --> 36:58.883
Yoda: Allow this appointment lightly
the council does not.

36:58.967 --> 37:02.429
Disturbing is this move
by chancellor palpatine.

37:03.596 --> 37:05.181
I understand.

37:05.265 --> 37:10.353
You are on this council, but we do not
Grant you the rank of master.

37:11.271 --> 37:12.480
What?

37:17.277 --> 37:20.947
How can you do this? This is outrageous.

37:21.698 --> 37:23.199
It's unfair.

37:24.576 --> 37:27.829
How can you be on the council
and not be a master?

37:27.912 --> 37:31.458
Take a seat, young Skywalker.

37:34.502 --> 37:36.796
Forgive me, master.

37:39.841 --> 37:42.802
Ki-adi-mundi: We have surveyed
all systems in the republic,

37:42.886 --> 37:46.639
but have found no sign
of general grievous.

37:46.723 --> 37:49.517
Hiding in the outer rim grievous is.

37:49.601 --> 37:52.729
The outlying systems you must sweep.

37:52.812 --> 37:55.064
We do not have many ships to spare.

37:55.148 --> 37:57.358
What about the droid attack
on the wookiees?

37:57.442 --> 38:01.154
It is critical we send
an attack group there immediately.

38:01.237 --> 38:04.699
He's right. It's a system
we cannot afford to lose.

38:05.992 --> 38:08.119
Go iwill.

38:08.203 --> 38:11.247
Good relations with the wookiees I have.

38:11.331 --> 38:15.668
It's settled then.
Yoda will take a battalion of clones

38:15.752 --> 38:18.087
to reinforce the wookiees on kashyyyk.

38:18.171 --> 38:20.256
May the force be with us all.

38:22.467 --> 38:25.136
Anakin: What kind of nonsense is this?

38:25.220 --> 38:27.639
Put me on the council
and not make me a master?

38:27.722 --> 38:30.475
It's never been done in the history
of the jedi. It's insulting.

38:30.558 --> 38:33.478
Oh, calm down, Anakin.
You have been given a great honor.

38:33.561 --> 38:37.607
To be on the council at your age,
it's never happened before.

38:37.690 --> 38:41.110
The fact of the matter is
you are too close to the chancellor.

38:41.194 --> 38:44.989
The council doesn't like it
when he interferes in jedi affairs.

38:45.073 --> 38:48.535
I swear to you, I didn't ask
to be put on the council.

38:48.618 --> 38:50.829
But it's what you wanted.

38:50.912 --> 38:54.249
Your friendship with chancellor
palpatine seems to have paid off.

38:54.332 --> 38:56.251
That has nothing to do with this.

38:56.334 --> 38:59.295
The only reason the council
has approved your appointment

38:59.379 --> 39:02.382
is because the chancellor trusts you.

39:02.465 --> 39:05.510
- And?
- Anakin, I am on your side.

39:05.593 --> 39:07.554
I didn't want to put you
in this situation.

39:07.637 --> 39:08.930
What situation?

39:12.976 --> 39:17.355
The council wants you to report
on all the chancellor's dealings.

39:17.438 --> 39:19.816
They want to know what he's up to.

39:24.320 --> 39:27.198
They want me to spy on the chancellor?

39:27.282 --> 39:28.449
But that's treason.

39:28.533 --> 39:29.951
We are at war, Anakin.

39:31.953 --> 39:34.914
Why didn't the council give me this
assignment when we were in session?

39:34.998 --> 39:37.458
This assignment is not to be on record.

39:37.542 --> 39:41.504
The chancellor
is not a bad man, Obi-Wan.

39:41.588 --> 39:44.632
He befriended me. He's watched out
for me ever since I arrived here.

39:44.716 --> 39:46.843
That is why you must help us.

39:46.926 --> 39:50.430
Anakin, our allegiance is to the senate,
not to its leader,

39:50.513 --> 39:54.225
who has managed to stay in office
long after his term has expired.

39:54.309 --> 39:56.311
The senate demanded that he stay longer.

39:56.394 --> 39:59.564
Yes, but use your feelings, Anakin.
Something is out of place.

39:59.647 --> 40:04.235
(Sighs) You're asking me
to do something against the jedi code,

40:04.319 --> 40:08.072
against the republic,
against a mentor and a friend.

40:08.156 --> 40:11.993
That's what's out of place here.
Why are you asking this of me?

40:14.287 --> 40:16.205
The council is asking you.

40:23.129 --> 40:27.926
Anakin did not take to his new
assignment with much enthusiasm.

40:28.009 --> 40:31.220
Windu: It's very dangerous,
putting them together.

40:31.304 --> 40:33.640
I don't think the boy can handle it.

40:33.723 --> 40:36.267
I don't trust him.

40:36.351 --> 40:40.229
With all due respect, master,
is he not the chosen one?

40:40.313 --> 40:44.025
Is he not to destroy the sith
and bring balance to the force?

40:44.108 --> 40:46.986
So the prophecy says.

40:47.070 --> 40:51.991
A prophecy that misread could have been.

40:53.785 --> 40:55.703
He will not let me down.

40:55.787 --> 40:57.747
He never has.

40:57.830 --> 41:00.875
I hope right you are.

41:13.721 --> 41:15.640
(Wookiee grunts)

41:24.190 --> 41:29.570
(Sighs) Sometimes iwonder
what's happening to the jedi order.

41:29.654 --> 41:32.740
I think this war is destroying
the principles of the republic.

41:34.575 --> 41:37.787
Have you ever considered
that we may be on the wrong side?

41:37.870 --> 41:40.373
What do you mean?

41:40.456 --> 41:45.086
What if the democracy we thought
we were serving no longer exists,

41:45.169 --> 41:48.798
and the republic has become the very
evil we've been fighting to destroy?

41:48.881 --> 41:50.925
I don't believe that.

41:51.009 --> 41:53.136
And you're sounding like a separatist.

41:55.096 --> 41:58.057
This war represents a failure to listen.

41:58.141 --> 42:00.184
Now you're closer
to the chancellor than anyone.

42:00.268 --> 42:03.563
Please, ask him to stop the fighting
and let diplomacy resume.

42:03.646 --> 42:06.232
Don't ask me to do that.

42:07.775 --> 42:11.446
Make a motion in the senate,
where that kind of a request belongs.

42:11.529 --> 42:14.365
- What is it?
- Nothing.

42:15.658 --> 42:19.537
Don't do this.
Don't shut me out. Let me help you.

42:21.581 --> 42:23.958
Hold me.

42:24.042 --> 42:27.211
Like you did by the lake on Naboo.

42:27.295 --> 42:31.090
So long ago,
when there was nothing but our love.

42:31.174 --> 42:34.635
No politics, no plotting, no war.

42:47.148 --> 42:50.902
(Droning)

42:50.985 --> 42:56.157
(Orchestra playing)

42:58.576 --> 43:01.496
(Applause in distance)

43:06.292 --> 43:11.339
- (Droning continues)
- (Applause)

43:13.841 --> 43:17.220
- You wanted to see me, chancellor.
- Yes, Anakin. Come closer.

43:17.303 --> 43:19.931
I have good news.

43:20.014 --> 43:22.308
Our clone intelligence units

43:22.391 --> 43:25.394
have discovered the location
of general grievous.

43:25.478 --> 43:27.396
He's hiding in the utapau system.

43:27.480 --> 43:29.398
At last.

43:30.775 --> 43:33.986
We'll be able to capture that monster
and end this war.

43:34.070 --> 43:37.448
I would worry about
the collective wisdom of the council

43:37.532 --> 43:39.951
if it didn't select you
for this assignment.

43:40.034 --> 43:43.412
You're the best choice, by far.

43:44.831 --> 43:47.834
Hmm. Sit down.

43:47.917 --> 43:49.836
Leave us.

43:49.919 --> 43:53.965
(Droning continues)

43:54.048 --> 43:57.468
(Applause)

44:01.806 --> 44:03.724
Anakin,

44:03.808 --> 44:08.271
you know I'm not able
to rely on the jedi council.

44:10.022 --> 44:14.235
If they haven't included you
in their plot, they soon will.

44:14.318 --> 44:16.445
I'm not sure I understand.

44:16.529 --> 44:20.241
You must sense
what I have come to suspect.

44:20.324 --> 44:23.744
The jedi council want control
of the republic.

44:25.079 --> 44:27.623
They're planning to betray me.

44:27.707 --> 44:30.126
- I don't think that...
- Anakin.

44:31.294 --> 44:33.254
Search your feelings.

44:35.423 --> 44:38.009
You know, don't you?

44:42.388 --> 44:45.516
- I know they don't trust you.
- Hmm. Or the senate.

44:45.600 --> 44:50.438
Or the republic, or democracy,
for that matter.

44:50.521 --> 44:55.568
I have to admit,
my trust in them has been shaken.

44:59.197 --> 45:01.240
They asked you to do something

45:01.324 --> 45:03.618
that made you feel dishonest,
didn't they?

45:06.621 --> 45:09.498
They asked you to spy on me,
didn't they?

45:14.045 --> 45:16.547
I don't, uh...

45:16.631 --> 45:18.549
I don't know what to say.

45:18.633 --> 45:22.220
Remember back to your early teachings.

45:22.303 --> 45:26.641
All who gain power are afraid
to lose it.

45:26.724 --> 45:28.601
Even the jedi.

45:28.684 --> 45:31.395
The jedi use their power for good.

45:31.479 --> 45:33.648
Good is a point of view, Anakin.

45:33.731 --> 45:38.945
The sith and the jedi
are similar in almost every way,

45:40.947 --> 45:43.741
including their quest for greater power.

45:45.243 --> 45:48.287
The sith rely on their passion
for their strength.

45:48.371 --> 45:51.165
They think inwards,
only about themselves.

45:52.333 --> 45:54.585
And the jedi don't?

45:54.669 --> 45:59.257
The jedi are selfless.
They only care about others.

45:59.340 --> 46:01.968
(Applause)

46:09.433 --> 46:14.438
Did you ever hear the tragedy
of darth plagueis the wise?

46:18.651 --> 46:21.112
- No.
- I thought not.

46:21.195 --> 46:23.614
It's not a story the jedi
would tell you.

46:25.032 --> 46:27.410
It's a sith legend.

46:27.493 --> 46:29.412
Darth plagueis

46:29.495 --> 46:35.167
was a dark lord of the sith
so powerful and so wise,

46:35.251 --> 46:40.131
he could use the force
to influence the midi-chlorians

46:40.214 --> 46:43.426
to create life.

46:45.052 --> 46:48.139
He had such a knowledge
of the dark side,

46:48.222 --> 46:53.269
he could even keep
the ones he cared about

46:53.352 --> 46:55.271
from dying.

46:59.567 --> 47:03.404
He could actually
save people from death?

47:03.487 --> 47:08.784
The dark side of the force
is a pathway to many abilities

47:08.868 --> 47:13.122
some consider to be unnatural.

47:14.206 --> 47:16.083
What happened to him?

47:16.167 --> 47:19.253
He became so powerful,

47:20.504 --> 47:23.507
the only thing he was afraid of was

47:23.591 --> 47:25.509
losing his power.

47:25.593 --> 47:29.055
Which eventually, of course, he did.

47:29.138 --> 47:35.019
Unfortunately, he taught his apprentice
everything he knew.

47:35.102 --> 47:38.814
Then his apprentice killed him
in his sleep.

47:40.941 --> 47:42.860
It's ironic.

47:42.943 --> 47:44.987
He could save others from death,

47:46.072 --> 47:48.199
but not himself.

47:52.328 --> 47:54.914
Is it possible to learn this power?

47:58.709 --> 48:00.878
Not from a jedi.

48:17.728 --> 48:21.148
Man: All red units, over here!
Let's go. Let's go. Move!

48:30.741 --> 48:34.537
Ki-adi-mundi: Palpatine thinks
general grievous is on utapau?

48:34.620 --> 48:37.706
A partial message was intercepted
in a diplomatic packet

48:37.790 --> 48:40.918
- from the chairman of utapau.
- Hmm.

48:41.001 --> 48:43.754
Act on this we must.

48:43.838 --> 48:48.592
The capture of general grievous
will end this war.

48:48.676 --> 48:52.555
Quickly and decisively
we should proceed.

48:52.638 --> 48:57.685
The chancellor has requested
that I lead the campaign.

48:57.768 --> 49:01.105
Windu: The council will make up
its own mind who is to go,

49:01.188 --> 49:03.190
not the chancellor.

49:03.274 --> 49:08.237
A master is needed,
with more experience.

49:08.320 --> 49:12.825
I concur. Master Kenobi should go.

49:12.908 --> 49:15.286
Yo da: 1 agree.
Ki-adi-mundi: Aye.

49:15.369 --> 49:17.288
Windu: Aye.

49:17.371 --> 49:21.125
- Windu: Very well. Council adjourned.
- (G ru nts)

49:22.168 --> 49:25.212
(Wookiees growling, grunting)

49:26.797 --> 49:27.798
(Grunts)

49:27.882 --> 49:29.985
The droids have started up
their main power generators.

49:30.009 --> 49:34.096
Then now the time is, commander.

49:34.180 --> 49:35.514
Yes, sir.

49:37.766 --> 49:41.061
- (Roaring)
- (All roaring)

49:47.693 --> 49:49.695
Charge!

50:04.585 --> 50:06.545
Man: Head for cover!

50:07.546 --> 50:12.426
- (Tarzan yell)
- (Roars)

50:22.102 --> 50:23.854
You're gonna need me
on this one, master.

50:23.938 --> 50:25.022
Oh, I agree.

50:25.105 --> 50:28.150
However, it may turn out
just to be a wild bantha chase.

50:28.234 --> 50:29.235
Master.

50:31.278 --> 50:32.780
I've disappointed you.

50:32.863 --> 50:36.492
Uh, I haven't been very appreciative
of your training.

50:36.575 --> 50:40.996
I've been arrogant, and I apologize.

50:41.080 --> 50:43.457
I've just been so frustrated
with the council.

50:46.752 --> 50:50.506
You are strong and wise, Anakin,
and I am very proud of you.

50:50.589 --> 50:53.217
I have trained you
since you were a small boy.

50:53.300 --> 50:55.427
I have taught you everything I know.

50:55.511 --> 50:59.265
And you have become a far greater jedi
than I could ever hope to be.

51:00.266 --> 51:02.059
But be patient, Anakin.

51:02.142 --> 51:06.146
It will not be long before the council
makes you a jedi master.

51:13.487 --> 51:16.782
Obi-Wan. May the force be with you.

51:16.865 --> 51:19.785
Goodbye, old friend.
May the force be with you.

51:42.349 --> 51:44.476
Man: Fortunately, most of the cities

51:44.560 --> 51:46.937
are concentrated
on this small continent here.

51:47.021 --> 51:48.606
On the far side.

51:48.689 --> 51:51.108
I'll keep them distracted
until you get there.

51:51.191 --> 51:52.860
Just don't take too long.

51:52.943 --> 51:54.612
Come on. When have I ever let you down?

51:54.695 --> 51:56.614
(Chuckles) Very well.

51:56.697 --> 52:01.201
The burden is on me not to destroy
all the droids until you arrive.

52:26.810 --> 52:28.729
Save your energy.

52:28.812 --> 52:30.856
(Sighs) I can't.

52:30.939 --> 52:32.733
Don't give up, Padmé.

52:34.943 --> 52:36.904
(Sighs)

52:46.205 --> 52:48.666
Obi-Wan's been here, hasn't he?

52:48.749 --> 52:50.834
He came by this morning.

52:52.211 --> 52:54.129
What did he want?

52:54.213 --> 52:56.173
He's worried about you.

52:58.634 --> 53:01.095
He says you've been
under a lot of stress.

53:01.178 --> 53:02.596
(Sighs)

53:04.181 --> 53:05.474
I feel lost.

53:06.600 --> 53:09.770
Lost? What do you mean?

53:11.647 --> 53:14.024
Obi-Wan and the council don't trust me.

53:14.108 --> 53:17.569
They trust you with their lives.

53:19.279 --> 53:21.365
Something's happening.

53:21.448 --> 53:24.118
I'm not the jedi I should be.

53:26.453 --> 53:28.414
I want more.

53:29.623 --> 53:31.542
And I know I shouldn't.

53:33.627 --> 53:35.629
You expect too much of yourself.

53:39.591 --> 53:42.803
- I found a way to save you.
- Save me?

53:42.886 --> 53:44.847
From my nightmares.

53:44.930 --> 53:46.890
Is that what's bothering you?

53:47.891 --> 53:50.561
I won't lose you, Padmé.

53:50.644 --> 53:52.771
I'm not gonna die in childbirth, ani.

53:52.855 --> 53:55.315
- I promise you.
- No, I promise you.

54:15.711 --> 54:17.796
(Creatures squawking)

54:29.224 --> 54:31.185
(Squawking)

54:39.234 --> 54:41.653
Greetings, young jedi.

54:41.737 --> 54:45.199
What brings you to our remote sanctuary?

54:45.282 --> 54:47.242
Unfortunately, the war.

54:47.326 --> 54:51.914
There's no war here
unless you brought it with you.

54:51.997 --> 54:55.209
With your kind permission,
I should like some fuel

54:55.292 --> 54:57.002
and to use your city as a base

54:57.085 --> 55:01.131
as I search nearby systems
for general grievous.

55:01.215 --> 55:04.510
(All speaking alien language)

55:09.223 --> 55:12.518
He is here. We are being held hostage.

55:12.601 --> 55:15.521
- They are watching us.
- I understand.

55:15.604 --> 55:20.442
Tenth level, thousands of battle droids.

55:20.526 --> 55:22.986
Tell your people to take shelter.

55:23.070 --> 55:26.073
If you have warriors, now is the time.

55:36.959 --> 55:41.171
Take the fighter back to the ship.
Tell Cody I've made contact.

55:41.255 --> 55:43.048
(Beeping)

55:43.131 --> 55:47.261
- Is he bringing additional warriors?
- He didn't say.

55:53.058 --> 55:54.977
(Squawking)

56:05.279 --> 56:06.780
(Squawking)

56:10.617 --> 56:12.911
(Yipping)

56:15.122 --> 56:17.082
(Snarls)

56:18.083 --> 56:20.544
(Yipping)

56:20.627 --> 56:22.880
(O rowls)

56:22.963 --> 56:24.923
(Yips)

56:25.007 --> 56:26.842
(Snarls)

56:29.553 --> 56:34.808
It won't be long before the armies
of the republic track us here.

56:34.892 --> 56:37.311
(Wheezing)

56:37.394 --> 56:42.649
I am sending you to
the mustafar system in the outer rim.

56:48.030 --> 56:50.032
(Yipping)

56:50.115 --> 56:52.451
It is a volcanic planet.

56:52.534 --> 56:55.871
- You will be safe there.
- Safe?

56:55.954 --> 56:59.958
Hmph! Chancellor palpatine
managed to escape your grip, general.

57:00.042 --> 57:04.504
Without count dooku, I have doubts
about your ability to keep us safe.

57:04.588 --> 57:07.549
Grievous: Be thankful, viceroy,

57:07.633 --> 57:10.552
you have not found yourself in my grip.

57:14.014 --> 57:17.517
Grievous: Your ship is waiting.

57:17.601 --> 57:20.354
(Coughing)

57:22.356 --> 57:26.068
(Hisses, snorts softly)

57:34.826 --> 57:35.827
Hello there.

57:37.746 --> 57:43.043
General Kenobi. (Cackles)

57:43.126 --> 57:45.671
You are a bold one.

57:45.754 --> 57:49.216
(Cackles) Kill him.

57:58.600 --> 58:01.103
(Yelping, whining)

58:05.023 --> 58:07.150
Back away.

58:07.234 --> 58:11.196
I will deal with this jedi slime myself.

58:11.279 --> 58:13.490
Your move.

58:13.573 --> 58:15.492
You fool.

58:15.575 --> 58:21.248
I've been trained in your
jedi arts by count dooku.

58:23.458 --> 58:25.711
(Coughing)

58:27.754 --> 58:30.257
Attack, Kenobi.

58:31.717 --> 58:34.886
(Cackles)

59:03.248 --> 59:04.583
(Grievous groans)

59:04.666 --> 59:08.128
(Growling)

59:09.296 --> 59:12.132
(O rowls)

59:17.429 --> 59:19.765
(Groaning)

59:23.769 --> 59:25.812
(Grunts)

59:27.939 --> 59:29.900
Man 1: Go, go, go, go! Move it! Move it!

59:29.983 --> 59:31.985
Everybody out.
Let's go, let's go, let's go.

59:32.069 --> 59:33.987
Man 2: Cover yourself. Come on.

59:39.117 --> 59:42.120
- (Cackling)
- Man 1: Move it! Move it!

59:42.204 --> 59:43.705
(Groaning)

59:43.789 --> 59:45.499
Man 1: Come on, move!
Come on, everybody!

59:46.583 --> 59:48.919
Army or not,

59:49.002 --> 59:54.132
you must realize you are doomed.

59:54.216 --> 59:56.218
Oh, I don't think so. (Grunts)

01:00:15.570 --> 01:00:16.571
(Battle droid screams)

01:00:20.659 --> 01:00:22.160
(Grunts)

01:00:25.205 --> 01:00:27.916
- (Whistles)
- Uh-oh.

01:00:27.999 --> 01:00:29.918
(Yipping)

01:00:33.046 --> 01:00:35.048
Hyah!

01:00:36.466 --> 01:00:38.468
(Screams)

01:00:49.855 --> 01:00:51.565
(O roans)

01:00:53.733 --> 01:00:55.986
- (Screams)
- Man: Cover that corner.

01:01:02.409 --> 01:01:04.494
Master windu, may I interrupt?

01:01:04.578 --> 01:01:07.372
General Kenobi has made contact
with general grievous,

01:01:07.455 --> 01:01:09.749
and we have begun our attack.

01:01:09.833 --> 01:01:12.252
Windu: Thank you, commander.

01:01:12.335 --> 01:01:15.505
Anakin, deliver this report
to the chancellor.

01:01:15.589 --> 01:01:18.175
His reaction will give us
a clue to his intentions.

01:01:18.258 --> 01:01:20.427
Yes, master.

01:01:27.184 --> 01:01:30.478
I sense a plot to destroy the jedi.

01:01:30.562 --> 01:01:33.190
The dark side of the force
surrounds the chancellor.

01:01:33.273 --> 01:01:35.984
If he does not give up
his emergency powers

01:01:36.067 --> 01:01:37.652
after the destruction of grievous,

01:01:37.736 --> 01:01:40.322
then he should be removed from office.

01:01:40.405 --> 01:01:44.075
The jedi council would have
to take control of the senate

01:01:44.159 --> 01:01:46.328
in order to secure
a peaceful transition.

01:01:46.411 --> 01:01:50.874
To a dark place
this line of thought will carry us.

01:01:50.957 --> 01:01:56.630
Hmm. Great care we must take.

01:02:02.677 --> 01:02:04.846
Chancellor.

01:02:04.930 --> 01:02:07.474
We've just received
a report from master Kenobi.

01:02:07.557 --> 01:02:10.227
He has engaged general grievous.

01:02:10.310 --> 01:02:13.688
We can only hope that master Kenobi
is up to the challenge.

01:02:15.523 --> 01:02:17.525
I should be there with him.

01:02:17.609 --> 01:02:19.986
It's upsetting to me
to see that the council

01:02:20.070 --> 01:02:23.365
doesn't seem
to fully appreciate your talents.

01:02:23.448 --> 01:02:27.577
Don't you wonder
why they won't make you a jedi master?

01:02:29.246 --> 01:02:31.248
I wish I knew.

01:02:32.540 --> 01:02:35.085
More and more I get the feeling that

01:02:35.168 --> 01:02:37.420
I'm being excluded from the council.

01:02:44.386 --> 01:02:48.348
I know there are things about the force
that they're not telling me.

01:02:50.558 --> 01:02:52.978
They don't trust you, Anakin.

01:02:53.061 --> 01:02:55.772
They see your future.

01:02:55.855 --> 01:03:00.819
They know your power
will be too strong to control.

01:03:00.902 --> 01:03:06.700
You must break through the fog of lies
the jedi have created around you.

01:03:07.993 --> 01:03:12.122
Let me help you to know
the subtleties of the force.

01:03:13.081 --> 01:03:15.000
How do you know the ways of the force?

01:03:15.083 --> 01:03:19.796
My mentor taught me everything
about the force.

01:03:19.879 --> 01:03:22.882
Even the nature of the dark side.

01:03:24.843 --> 01:03:27.178
You know the dark side?

01:03:27.887 --> 01:03:29.723
Anakin,

01:03:29.806 --> 01:03:33.143
if one is to understand
the great mystery,

01:03:33.226 --> 01:03:35.812
one must study all its aspects,

01:03:35.895 --> 01:03:38.857
not just the dogmatic narrow view
of the jedi.

01:03:38.940 --> 01:03:42.777
If you wish to become
a complete and wise leader,

01:03:42.861 --> 01:03:46.531
you must embrace
a larger view of the force.

01:03:46.614 --> 01:03:49.242
Be careful of the jedi, Anakin.

01:03:49.993 --> 01:03:51.536
Only through me

01:03:51.619 --> 01:03:55.498
can you achieve a power greater
than any jedi.

01:03:55.582 --> 01:03:58.918
Learn to know the dark side
of the force,

01:03:59.002 --> 01:04:02.672
and you will be able to save your wife

01:04:02.756 --> 01:04:04.841
from certain death.

01:04:05.925 --> 01:04:07.844
What did you say?

01:04:07.927 --> 01:04:11.598
Use my knowledge. I beg you.

01:04:13.266 --> 01:04:15.477
You're the sith lord.

01:04:15.560 --> 01:04:19.439
I know what's been troubling you.
Listen to me.

01:04:19.522 --> 01:04:24.110
Don't continue to be a pawn
of the jedi council.

01:04:26.237 --> 01:04:29.699
Ever since I've known you,
you've been searching for a life

01:04:29.783 --> 01:04:32.369
greater than that of an ordinary jedi.

01:04:32.452 --> 01:04:34.871
A life of significance,

01:04:34.954 --> 01:04:37.332
of conscience.

01:04:41.461 --> 01:04:45.757
- Are you going to kill me?
- I would certainly like to.

01:04:46.800 --> 01:04:49.219
I know you would.

01:04:49.302 --> 01:04:53.139
I can feel your anger.

01:04:53.223 --> 01:04:55.934
It gives you focus,

01:04:56.017 --> 01:04:58.395
makes you stronger.

01:05:04.651 --> 01:05:07.237
I'm going to turn you over
to the jedi council.

01:05:07.320 --> 01:05:08.780
Of course. You should.

01:05:08.863 --> 01:05:11.908
But you're not sure
of their intentions, are you?

01:05:11.991 --> 01:05:15.578
I will quickly discover
the truth of all this.

01:05:15.662 --> 01:05:18.081
You have great wisdom, Anakin.

01:05:18.164 --> 01:05:21.835
Know the power of the dark side.

01:05:21.918 --> 01:05:24.712
Power to save Padmé.

01:05:27.507 --> 01:05:28.508
(Yipping)

01:05:33.638 --> 01:05:35.348
- (Yipping)
- (Panting)

01:05:52.365 --> 01:05:53.366
(Grunts)

01:05:56.703 --> 01:05:57.704
(Yipping)

01:06:21.394 --> 01:06:23.188
(O roans)

01:06:24.939 --> 01:06:26.858
(O roans)

01:06:30.737 --> 01:06:32.322
(O rowls)

01:06:32.405 --> 01:06:34.115
(O roans)

01:06:34.199 --> 01:06:35.700
(O rowls)

01:06:42.624 --> 01:06:44.459
(Gasps, shouts)

01:06:45.168 --> 01:06:47.212
(O roans)

01:06:53.885 --> 01:06:55.929
- Aaah!
- (Cackling)

01:07:13.863 --> 01:07:15.031
(O roans)

01:07:19.160 --> 01:07:21.162
(Groaning)

01:07:28.169 --> 01:07:30.588
(Grunts)

01:07:32.465 --> 01:07:34.384
So uncivilized.

01:07:34.467 --> 01:07:36.469
(Sizzling)

01:07:41.891 --> 01:07:43.935
Anakin: Master windu,
I must talk to you.

01:07:44.018 --> 01:07:48.106
Skywalker, we just received word that
Obi-Wan has destroyed general grievous.

01:07:48.189 --> 01:07:49.909
We're on our way to make sure
the chancellor

01:07:49.983 --> 01:07:52.151
returns emergency power
back to the senate.

01:07:52.235 --> 01:07:55.989
He won't give up his power.
I've just learned a terrible truth.

01:07:56.072 --> 01:07:59.200
I think chancellor palpatine
is a sith lord.

01:07:59.284 --> 01:08:01.244
A sith lord?

01:08:01.327 --> 01:08:04.205
Yes. The one we've been looking for.

01:08:04.289 --> 01:08:05.790
How do you know this?

01:08:05.873 --> 01:08:08.251
He knows the ways of the force.

01:08:08.334 --> 01:08:10.503
He's been trained to use the dark side.

01:08:10.587 --> 01:08:13.423
- Are you sure?
- Absolutely.

01:08:14.841 --> 01:08:17.093
Then our worst fears have been realized.

01:08:17.176 --> 01:08:20.680
We must move quickly
if the jedi order is to survive.

01:08:20.763 --> 01:08:23.224
Master, the chancellor is very powerful.

01:08:23.308 --> 01:08:25.602
You'll need my help
if you're going to arrest him.

01:08:25.685 --> 01:08:28.646
For your own good,
stay out of this affair.

01:08:28.730 --> 01:08:31.524
I sense a great deal of confusion
in you, young Skywalker.

01:08:31.608 --> 01:08:33.776
There is much fear
that clouds your judgment.

01:08:33.860 --> 01:08:36.070
- I must go, master.
- No.

01:08:38.031 --> 01:08:40.033
If what you've told me is true,

01:08:40.116 --> 01:08:42.035
you will have gained my trust.

01:08:42.118 --> 01:08:44.704
But for now, remain here.

01:08:45.872 --> 01:08:48.708
Wait in the council chambers
until we return.

01:08:50.043 --> 01:08:52.253
- (Click, whirring)
- Yes, master.

01:09:21.991 --> 01:09:24.619
Palpatine: You do know, don't you,

01:09:24.702 --> 01:09:27.080
if the jedi destroy me,

01:09:27.163 --> 01:09:31.167
any chance of saving her will be lost.

01:11:00.047 --> 01:11:04.510
Master windu. I take it general grievous
has been destroyed then.

01:11:05.303 --> 01:11:07.889
I must say you're here
sooner than expected.

01:11:07.972 --> 01:11:11.601
In the name
of the galactic senate of the republic,

01:11:11.684 --> 01:11:13.644
you're under arrest, chancellor.

01:11:13.728 --> 01:11:16.355
Are you threatening me, master jedi?

01:11:16.439 --> 01:11:18.399
The senate will decide your fate.

01:11:18.483 --> 01:11:22.361
- I am the senate.
- Not yet.

01:11:27.575 --> 01:11:30.036
It's treason then.

01:11:31.621 --> 01:11:33.581
(Snarls)

01:11:35.875 --> 01:11:37.877
- (Screams)
- (Screams)

01:11:42.882 --> 01:11:44.217
(Screams)

01:12:04.070 --> 01:12:06.906
(Grunting)

01:12:47.947 --> 01:12:49.949
(Snarls)

01:12:55.663 --> 01:12:57.623
(Groaning)

01:12:57.707 --> 01:12:59.959
(Gasping)

01:13:09.135 --> 01:13:12.555
You are under arrest, my lord.

01:13:13.639 --> 01:13:16.225
Anakin, I told you
it would come to this.

01:13:16.309 --> 01:13:17.977
I was right.

01:13:18.060 --> 01:13:20.229
The jedi are taking over.

01:13:20.313 --> 01:13:22.815
The oppression of the sith
will never return.

01:13:22.899 --> 01:13:25.151
You have lost.

01:13:27.320 --> 01:13:30.948
No. No. You will die!

01:13:32.992 --> 01:13:35.578
He's a traitor!

01:13:35.661 --> 01:13:38.998
He is the traitor! (Groaning)

01:13:40.583 --> 01:13:45.212
I have the power to save
the one you love.

01:13:45.296 --> 01:13:48.132
You must choose.

01:13:49.175 --> 01:13:51.802
Don't listen to him, Anakin!

01:13:52.845 --> 01:13:55.514
Don't let him kill me.

01:13:58.601 --> 01:14:01.354
I can't hold it any longer.

01:14:01.437 --> 01:14:04.690
(Stammering) I can't. I'm weak.

01:14:04.774 --> 01:14:06.859
I'm too weak.

01:14:06.943 --> 01:14:08.402
- Anakin.
- (Grunts)

01:14:08.486 --> 01:14:10.988
Help me. Help me!

01:14:12.114 --> 01:14:14.033
(O roans)

01:14:14.116 --> 01:14:17.662
I can't hold on any longer.

01:14:17.745 --> 01:14:20.915
I am going to end this once and for all.

01:14:20.998 --> 01:14:22.959
Anakin: You can't.

01:14:23.042 --> 01:14:25.002
He must stand trial.

01:14:25.836 --> 01:14:28.506
He has control of the senate
and the courts.

01:14:28.589 --> 01:14:30.841
He's too dangerous to be left alive.

01:14:30.925 --> 01:14:34.929
I'm too weak. Oh. Don't kill me. Please.

01:14:35.012 --> 01:14:36.931
Anakin: It's not the jedi way.

01:14:37.014 --> 01:14:38.557
He must live.

01:14:40.810 --> 01:14:42.812
Please don't.

01:14:42.895 --> 01:14:44.230
I need him.

01:14:45.231 --> 01:14:47.525
- Please don't!
- No!

01:14:48.442 --> 01:14:50.903
(Screams)

01:14:53.489 --> 01:14:56.283
Power!

01:14:58.077 --> 01:14:59.912
(Screaming)

01:15:01.998 --> 01:15:06.627
Unlimited power!

01:15:14.051 --> 01:15:16.053
(Sighs)

01:15:17.054 --> 01:15:19.598
What have I done?

01:15:20.141 --> 01:15:21.809
(Thunder rumbling)

01:15:21.892 --> 01:15:24.103
(Moans)

01:15:28.065 --> 01:15:32.111
You're fulfilling your destiny, Anakin.

01:15:33.821 --> 01:15:35.948
Become my apprentice.

01:15:36.032 --> 01:15:41.495
Learn to use the dark side of the force.

01:15:44.123 --> 01:15:47.126
I will do whatever you ask.

01:15:49.336 --> 01:15:51.756
Good.

01:15:53.424 --> 01:15:56.052
Just help me save padme's life.

01:15:57.970 --> 01:16:00.389
I can't live without her.

01:16:00.473 --> 01:16:03.434
(Raspy breathing)

01:16:03.517 --> 01:16:08.439
To cheat death is a power
only one has achieved,

01:16:08.522 --> 01:16:12.234
but if we work together,

01:16:12.318 --> 01:16:16.155
I know we can discover the secret.

01:16:17.573 --> 01:16:19.909
I pledge myself

01:16:21.285 --> 01:16:24.330
- to your teachings.
- (Murmurs)

01:16:24.413 --> 01:16:26.457
Good.

01:16:26.540 --> 01:16:29.126
Good.

01:16:29.210 --> 01:16:33.339
(Raspy breathing)

01:16:34.673 --> 01:16:37.301
(Growls softly)

01:16:37.384 --> 01:16:41.847
The force is strong with you.

01:16:41.931 --> 01:16:47.520
A powerful sith you will become.

01:16:47.603 --> 01:16:51.899
Henceforth you shall be known as,

01:16:51.982 --> 01:16:53.317
dadh

01:16:54.693 --> 01:16:56.237
vader.

01:17:00.825 --> 01:17:03.869
Thank you, my master.

01:17:06.038 --> 01:17:08.040
Rise.

01:17:14.380 --> 01:17:16.382
(Murmurs)

01:17:16.465 --> 01:17:19.009
(Laser blasters firing in distance)

01:17:19.093 --> 01:17:21.095
(Sighs)

01:17:21.178 --> 01:17:26.142
Palpatine: Because the council did not
trust you, my young apprentice,

01:17:27.685 --> 01:17:32.481
I believe you are the only jedi
with no knowledge of this plot.

01:17:33.774 --> 01:17:36.527
When the jedi learn
what has transpired here,

01:17:36.610 --> 01:17:38.612
they will kill us,

01:17:38.696 --> 01:17:41.323
along with all the senators.

01:17:41.407 --> 01:17:43.409
I agree.

01:17:43.492 --> 01:17:47.121
The council's next move
will be against the senate.

01:17:47.204 --> 01:17:50.207
Every single jedi,

01:17:50.291 --> 01:17:53.586
including your friend Obi-Wan Kenobi,

01:17:53.669 --> 01:17:57.256
is now an enemy of the republic.

01:17:58.257 --> 01:18:00.259
I understand, master.

01:18:00.342 --> 01:18:02.970
We must move quickly.

01:18:03.053 --> 01:18:05.014
The jedi are relentless.

01:18:05.097 --> 01:18:10.936
If they are not all destroyed,
it will be civil war without end.

01:18:12.605 --> 01:18:16.609
First I want you to go
to the jedi temple.

01:18:17.484 --> 01:18:20.613
We will catch them off-balance.

01:18:21.322 --> 01:18:24.658
Do what must be done, lord vader.

01:18:24.742 --> 01:18:28.746
Do not hesitate. Show no mercy.

01:18:28.829 --> 01:18:33.626
Only then will you be strong enough
with the dark side

01:18:33.709 --> 01:18:36.128
to save Padmé.

01:18:36.837 --> 01:18:40.716
What about the other jedi
spread across the galaxy?

01:18:40.799 --> 01:18:43.928
Their betrayal will be dealt with.

01:18:45.804 --> 01:18:49.099
After you have killed
all the jedi in the temple,

01:18:49.183 --> 01:18:51.894
go to the mustafar system.

01:18:51.977 --> 01:18:55.272
Wipe out viceroy gunray

01:18:55.356 --> 01:18:58.817
and the other separatist leaders.

01:18:58.901 --> 01:19:04.823
Once more the sith will rule the galaxy!

01:19:06.033 --> 01:19:07.952
And

01:19:08.035 --> 01:19:12.831
we shall have peace.

01:19:56.166 --> 01:19:59.003
Sergeant, over here!

01:19:59.086 --> 01:20:01.171
Hurry! Follow them!

01:20:01.839 --> 01:20:03.048
(Screams)

01:20:03.966 --> 01:20:05.718
All red units, let's move it!

01:20:05.801 --> 01:20:07.720
Come on. Let's go!

01:20:09.847 --> 01:20:11.682
(Screeches)

01:20:15.978 --> 01:20:18.564
(Yipping)

01:20:21.567 --> 01:20:23.610
Commander, contact your troops.

01:20:23.694 --> 01:20:25.654
Tell them to move to the higher levels.

01:20:25.738 --> 01:20:27.656
Very good, sir.

01:20:27.740 --> 01:20:29.908
Oh, by the way,
I think you'll be needing this.

01:20:29.992 --> 01:20:33.579
Thank you, Cody. Now let's get a
move on. We've got a battle to win here.

01:20:33.662 --> 01:20:35.581
- Hyah!
- Yes, sir.

01:20:38.375 --> 01:20:39.668
(Beeping)

01:20:42.338 --> 01:20:44.423
Commander Cody,

01:20:44.506 --> 01:20:47.843
the time has come.

01:20:47.926 --> 01:20:52.181
Execute order 66.

01:20:52.264 --> 01:20:54.266
Yes, my lord.

01:20:56.060 --> 01:20:58.645
(Yipping)

01:20:58.729 --> 01:21:00.105
Blast him!

01:21:03.317 --> 01:21:05.527
(Yipping)

01:21:06.653 --> 01:21:09.073
(Screaming)

01:21:27.091 --> 01:21:28.467
Come on!

01:21:30.552 --> 01:21:32.763
(Weapons cocking)

01:21:37.184 --> 01:21:39.395
(O roans)

01:21:40.938 --> 01:21:42.898
(Squawking)

01:22:18.517 --> 01:22:23.063
Execute order 66.

01:22:23.147 --> 01:22:24.815
It will be done, my lord.

01:22:47.254 --> 01:22:49.214
(Squawking)

01:23:07.608 --> 01:23:09.902
- It will be done, my lord.
- (Beeps)

01:23:21.121 --> 01:23:23.749
(Wookiees roaring)

01:23:26.335 --> 01:23:28.670
(Both growl)

01:23:29.755 --> 01:23:32.841
(Both murmuring, roaring)

01:23:46.438 --> 01:23:48.857
Master Skywalker,
there are too many of them.

01:23:48.941 --> 01:23:50.943
What are we going to do?

01:24:01.411 --> 01:24:03.038
The chancellor's office indicated

01:24:03.121 --> 01:24:05.582
master Anakin returned
to the jedi temple.

01:24:05.666 --> 01:24:08.794
Don't worry.
I'm sure he'll be all right.

01:24:16.093 --> 01:24:17.803
(Sobbing)

01:24:37.990 --> 01:24:41.076
- What's going on here?
- There's been a rebellion, sir.

01:24:41.159 --> 01:24:43.745
Don't worry.
The situation is under control.

01:24:43.829 --> 01:24:47.124
I'm sorry, sir.
It's time for you to leave.

01:24:48.834 --> 01:24:50.794
And so it is.

01:24:54.423 --> 01:24:57.134
- (Lightsaber activates)
- Get him!

01:25:13.275 --> 01:25:15.861
Don't worry about him. Let him go.

01:25:25.912 --> 01:25:28.332
(Grunting)

01:25:32.127 --> 01:25:34.087
(Beeping)

01:25:42.721 --> 01:25:45.682
All these wookiees are dead.
Move to the east.

01:25:45.766 --> 01:25:47.768
Yes, sir.

01:25:51.897 --> 01:25:53.899
(Murmurs)

01:25:55.359 --> 01:25:57.277
Goodbye, tarfful.

01:25:57.361 --> 01:25:59.321
Good bye, Chewbacca.

01:25:59.404 --> 01:26:01.073
(Roars)

01:26:01.156 --> 01:26:04.076
Miss you I will.

01:26:04.159 --> 01:26:06.078
(Roars softly)

01:26:07.954 --> 01:26:09.956
(Both murmuring)

01:26:10.040 --> 01:26:11.208
(Roars)

01:26:17.964 --> 01:26:19.925
(Both murmuring)

01:26:26.640 --> 01:26:28.892
(Murmurs)

01:26:28.975 --> 01:26:31.103
(Roars)

01:26:41.071 --> 01:26:43.365
Hopefully we'll be able
to intercept a few jedi

01:26:43.448 --> 01:26:45.867
before they walk into this catastrophe.

01:26:51.498 --> 01:26:53.458
Cody: Did you find Kenobi?

01:26:53.542 --> 01:26:55.544
Sir, no one could have survived
that fall.

01:26:55.627 --> 01:26:58.964
Cody: Start loading your men
on the ships.

01:26:59.047 --> 01:27:01.842
Move it.

01:27:31.621 --> 01:27:33.749
(Beeping)

01:27:33.832 --> 01:27:35.876
Emergency code 913.

01:27:35.959 --> 01:27:37.878
I have no contact on any frequency.

01:27:39.921 --> 01:27:42.048
(Distorted) Master Kenobi.

01:27:42.132 --> 01:27:44.134
- Repeat.
- Master Kenobi.

01:27:44.217 --> 01:27:48.138
Senator organa. My clone troops
turned on me. I need help.

01:27:48.221 --> 01:27:50.849
We have just rescued master Yoda.

01:27:50.932 --> 01:27:53.268
It appears this ambush
has happened everywhere.

01:27:53.351 --> 01:27:55.520
We 're sending you our coordinates.

01:28:02.194 --> 01:28:05.155
- (Beeping)
- Hush! Not so loud.

01:28:05.238 --> 01:28:06.656
Are you all right?

01:28:06.740 --> 01:28:08.342
I heard there was an attack
on the jedi temple.

01:28:08.366 --> 01:28:10.869
- You could see the smoke from here.
- I'm fine. I'm fine.

01:28:10.952 --> 01:28:13.288
I came to see if you
and the baby are safe.

01:28:13.371 --> 01:28:14.498
What's happening?

01:28:14.581 --> 01:28:17.459
The jedi have tried
to overthrow the republic.

01:28:17.542 --> 01:28:20.128
I can't believe that.

01:28:20.212 --> 01:28:24.800
I saw master windu attempt
to assassinate the chancellor myself.

01:28:24.883 --> 01:28:28.386
Oh, Anakin. What are you gonna do?

01:28:37.062 --> 01:28:39.272
I will not betray the republic.

01:28:41.233 --> 01:28:43.235
My loyalties lie with the chancellor

01:28:44.319 --> 01:28:47.072
and with the senate and with you.

01:28:47.155 --> 01:28:49.366
What about Obi-Wan?

01:28:49.449 --> 01:28:51.701
I don't know.

01:28:51.785 --> 01:28:53.912
Many jedi have been killed.

01:28:53.995 --> 01:28:57.833
We can only hope that he's remained
loyal to the chancellor.

01:28:57.916 --> 01:29:00.293
Anakin, I'm afraid.

01:29:02.212 --> 01:29:05.340
Have faith, my love.

01:29:05.423 --> 01:29:07.759
Everything will soon be set right.

01:29:07.843 --> 01:29:11.263
The chancellor has given me
a very important mission.

01:29:11.346 --> 01:29:14.558
The separatists have gathered
on the mustafar system.

01:29:14.641 --> 01:29:17.185
I'm going there to end this war.

01:29:17.269 --> 01:29:19.187
Wait for me until I return.

01:29:19.271 --> 01:29:21.690
Things will be different. I promise.

01:29:27.487 --> 01:29:29.489
Please, wait for me.

01:29:31.032 --> 01:29:33.451
(R2-d2 beeps)

01:29:33.535 --> 01:29:36.288
Well, he is under a lot of stress, R2.

01:29:36.371 --> 01:29:38.415
(Beeping, whistling)

01:29:38.498 --> 01:29:40.458
Take care, my little friend.

01:29:44.713 --> 01:29:48.425
Oh, my lady, is there anything
I might do?

01:29:48.508 --> 01:29:51.052
No, thank you, 3po.

01:29:51.136 --> 01:29:55.891
Oh. I... I feel so helpless.

01:30:18.705 --> 01:30:22.083
How many other jedi
have managed to survive?

01:30:22.167 --> 01:30:25.503
Heard from no one have we.

01:30:25.587 --> 01:30:28.715
I saw thousands of troops
attack the jedi temple.

01:30:28.798 --> 01:30:30.717
That's why I went looking for Yoda.

01:30:30.800 --> 01:30:33.386
Have we had any contact from the temple?

01:30:33.470 --> 01:30:36.348
Received a coded retreat message
we have.

01:30:36.431 --> 01:30:40.477
It requests all jedi to return
to the temple.

01:30:40.560 --> 01:30:44.022
- It says the war is over.
- Well, then we must go back.

01:30:44.105 --> 01:30:47.609
If there are any stragglers, they
will fall into the trap and be killed.

01:30:47.692 --> 01:30:52.572
Hmm. Suggest dismantling
the coded signal, do you?

01:30:52.656 --> 01:30:55.408
Yes, master. There is too much at stake.

01:30:55.492 --> 01:30:58.078
I agree.

01:30:58.161 --> 01:31:01.790
And a little more knowledge
might light our way.

01:31:22.727 --> 01:31:26.189
The plan has gone
as you had promised, my lord.

01:31:26.272 --> 01:31:29.067
You have done well, viceroy.

01:31:29.150 --> 01:31:34.990
When my new apprentice
Darth Vader arrives,

01:31:35.073 --> 01:31:38.618
he will take care of you.

01:31:50.213 --> 01:31:53.341
We're receiving a message
from the chancellor's office, sir.

01:31:53.425 --> 01:31:55.427
- Send it through.
- Yes, sir.

01:31:57.137 --> 01:32:01.850
Senator organa, the supreme chancellor
requests your presence

01:32:01.933 --> 01:32:03.935
at a special session of congress.

01:32:04.019 --> 01:32:07.605
- I will be there.
- He'll be expecting you.

01:32:10.567 --> 01:32:13.862
- Could be a trap.
- I don't think so.

01:32:13.945 --> 01:32:17.073
The chancellor will not be able to
control the thousands of star systems

01:32:17.157 --> 01:32:19.117
without keeping the senate intact.

01:32:20.035 --> 01:32:23.246
If a special session
of congress there is,

01:32:23.329 --> 01:32:27.000
easier for us to enter
the jedi temple it will be.

01:32:50.065 --> 01:32:52.734
(Whistles)

01:33:02.619 --> 01:33:05.038
(Whistles)

01:33:05.121 --> 01:33:07.123
R2, stay with the ship.

01:33:09.375 --> 01:33:11.544
(Beeping, whistling)

01:33:15.673 --> 01:33:18.927
(Speaking geonosian)

01:33:19.010 --> 01:33:22.680
(Beeping, squeaking)

01:33:31.815 --> 01:33:35.568
Welcome, lord vader.
We've been expecting you.

01:33:47.956 --> 01:33:49.958
(Screams)

01:33:52.418 --> 01:33:53.753
(Shouts)

01:33:54.504 --> 01:33:56.214
(Groans) (Thud)

01:33:57.257 --> 01:33:58.258
(O roans)

01:34:00.301 --> 01:34:01.553
(Grunts)

01:34:05.390 --> 01:34:07.308
(Applause)

01:34:07.392 --> 01:34:11.938
Palpatine: And the jedi rebellion
has been foiled.

01:34:12.021 --> 01:34:13.189
What's happened?

01:34:13.273 --> 01:34:14.375
The chancellor's been elaborating

01:34:14.399 --> 01:34:17.735
on a plot by the jedi
to overthrow the senate.

01:34:17.819 --> 01:34:23.324
The remaining jedi
will be hunted down and defeated.

01:34:23.408 --> 01:34:25.410
(Applause)

01:34:39.090 --> 01:34:41.593
Not even the younglings survived.

01:34:42.677 --> 01:34:44.637
Killed not by clones

01:34:44.721 --> 01:34:47.974
this padawan.

01:34:49.058 --> 01:34:51.728
By a lightsaber he was.

01:34:58.568 --> 01:35:02.155
Who? Who could have done this?

01:35:04.908 --> 01:35:06.910
(O roans)

01:35:09.829 --> 01:35:12.749
(Applause)

01:35:12.832 --> 01:35:16.044
The attempt on my life

01:35:16.127 --> 01:35:18.796
has left me scarred

01:35:18.880 --> 01:35:21.883
and deformed.

01:35:21.966 --> 01:35:24.886
But I assure you.

01:35:24.969 --> 01:35:29.724
My resolve has never been stronger!

01:35:29.807 --> 01:35:32.685
(Applause)

01:35:33.895 --> 01:35:36.105
Stop! No!

01:35:36.189 --> 01:35:37.774
(Screams)

01:35:37.857 --> 01:35:40.026
(O roans)

01:35:47.408 --> 01:35:51.079
In order to ensure the security

01:35:51.162 --> 01:35:53.748
and continuing stability,

01:35:53.831 --> 01:35:57.752
the republic will be reorganized

01:35:57.835 --> 01:36:03.299
into the first galactic empire!

01:36:03.383 --> 01:36:05.426
- (Applause)
- For a safe

01:36:05.510 --> 01:36:10.098
and secure society.

01:36:10.181 --> 01:36:13.309
(Applause)

01:36:19.482 --> 01:36:22.193
So this is how Liberty dies.

01:36:22.277 --> 01:36:25.029
With thunderous applause.

01:36:27.407 --> 01:36:29.617
The war is over.

01:36:29.701 --> 01:36:33.830
Lord Sidious promised us peace.
We only want...

01:36:33.913 --> 01:36:35.373
(Screams)

01:36:41.963 --> 01:36:46.676
I have recalibrated the code,
warning all surviving jedi to stay away.

01:36:46.759 --> 01:36:49.220
For the clones

01:36:49.304 --> 01:36:53.433
to discover the recalibration
a long time it will take.

01:37:05.737 --> 01:37:07.822
Wait. Master.

01:37:08.656 --> 01:37:11.117
There is something I must know.

01:37:17.206 --> 01:37:19.667
If into the security recordings you go,

01:37:19.751 --> 01:37:21.669
only pain will you find.

01:37:21.753 --> 01:37:25.256
I must know the truth, master.

01:37:28.092 --> 01:37:31.054
(Mu rmu rs softly)

01:37:32.096 --> 01:37:34.057
It can't be.

01:37:34.140 --> 01:37:36.059
It can't be.

01:37:36.142 --> 01:37:40.229
You have done well, my new apprentice.

01:37:40.313 --> 01:37:43.358
Now, lord vader,

01:37:43.441 --> 01:37:46.986
go and bring peace to the empire.

01:37:47.070 --> 01:37:49.238
I can't watch any more.

01:37:49.322 --> 01:37:53.951
Destroy the sith we must.

01:37:55.703 --> 01:37:57.830
Send me to kill the emperor.

01:37:57.914 --> 01:38:00.208
I will not kill Anakin.

01:38:00.291 --> 01:38:05.046
To fight this lord Sidious,
strong enough you are not.

01:38:05.129 --> 01:38:08.383
He is like my brother. I cannot do it.

01:38:08.466 --> 01:38:14.222
Twisted by the dark side
young Skywalker has become.

01:38:14.305 --> 01:38:17.725
The boy you trained, gone he is.

01:38:17.809 --> 01:38:20.728
Consumed by Darth Vader.

01:38:20.812 --> 01:38:23.856
I do not know
where the emperor has sent him.

01:38:23.940 --> 01:38:26.192
I don't know where to look.

01:38:27.485 --> 01:38:31.197
Use your feelings, Obi-Wan,
and find him you will.

01:38:41.707 --> 01:38:44.335
When was the last time you saw him?

01:38:44.419 --> 01:38:45.837
Yesterday.

01:38:45.920 --> 01:38:47.839
And do you know where he is now?

01:38:50.967 --> 01:38:54.595
Padmé, I need your help.

01:38:54.679 --> 01:38:57.682
- He is in grave danger.
- From the sith?

01:38:57.765 --> 01:38:59.767
From himself.

01:39:02.186 --> 01:39:04.272
Padmé,

01:39:04.355 --> 01:39:06.774
Anakin has turned to the dark side.

01:39:06.858 --> 01:39:10.361
You're wrong.
How could you even say that?

01:39:13.114 --> 01:39:16.951
I have seen a security hologram

01:39:17.034 --> 01:39:19.495
of him

01:39:19.579 --> 01:39:21.497
killing younglings.

01:39:21.581 --> 01:39:24.625
Not Anakin. He couldn't.

01:39:24.709 --> 01:39:27.712
He was deceived by a lie. We all were.

01:39:27.795 --> 01:39:32.341
It appears that the chancellor
is behind everything, including the war.

01:39:34.135 --> 01:39:36.888
Palpatine is the sith lord
we've been looking for.

01:39:36.971 --> 01:39:41.100
After the death of count dooku,
Anakin became his new apprentice.

01:39:47.273 --> 01:39:49.275
I don't believe you.

01:39:50.651 --> 01:39:52.653
I can't.

01:39:57.742 --> 01:39:58.910
Padmé,

01:40:00.328 --> 01:40:02.622
I must find him.

01:40:05.082 --> 01:40:07.084
You're going to kill him, aren't you?

01:40:10.755 --> 01:40:13.257
He has become a very great threat.

01:40:15.843 --> 01:40:17.845
I can't.

01:40:31.025 --> 01:40:32.985
Anakin is the father, isn't he?

01:40:37.448 --> 01:40:38.950
I'm so sorry.

01:41:25.288 --> 01:41:26.723
Typho: Milady, let me come with you.

01:41:26.747 --> 01:41:29.709
Padme: There's no danger. The fighting's
over. And this is personal.

01:41:29.792 --> 01:41:32.211
As you wish, milady,
but I strongly disagree.

01:41:32.295 --> 01:41:35.965
I'll be all right, captain.
This is something I must do myself.

01:41:36.048 --> 01:41:38.467
Besides, 3po will look after me.

01:41:40.303 --> 01:41:42.305
C-3po: Oh, dear.

01:41:52.898 --> 01:41:55.026
- (Beeps)
- Do you know?

01:41:55.109 --> 01:41:58.738
I think I'm beginning to get the hang
of this flying business. Hmm.

01:41:58.821 --> 01:42:02.700
(Rewing)

01:42:26.098 --> 01:42:29.560
The separatists
have been taken care of, my master.

01:42:29.644 --> 01:42:32.563
It is finished then.

01:42:33.939 --> 01:42:39.779
You have restored
peace and justice to the galaxy.

01:42:39.862 --> 01:42:44.784
Send a message to the ships
of the trade federation.

01:42:44.867 --> 01:42:50.039
All droid units
must shut down immediately.

01:42:50.122 --> 01:42:52.249
Very good, my lord.

01:42:53.376 --> 01:42:55.378
(Beeping)

01:43:40.423 --> 01:43:41.966
(Hatch opens)

01:43:52.143 --> 01:43:54.270
Anakin: I saw your ship.

01:43:57.064 --> 01:44:00.109
- What are you doing out here?
- I was so worried about you.

01:44:01.527 --> 01:44:04.405
Obi-Wan told me terrible things.

01:44:04.488 --> 01:44:06.657
What things?

01:44:06.741 --> 01:44:09.702
He said you've turned to the dark side.

01:44:09.785 --> 01:44:12.204
That you

01:44:12.288 --> 01:44:14.457
killed younglings.

01:44:15.958 --> 01:44:18.669
Obi-Wan is trying
to turn you against me.

01:44:18.753 --> 01:44:22.548
- He cares about us.
- Us?

01:44:22.631 --> 01:44:25.384
He knows.

01:44:25.468 --> 01:44:27.386
He wants to help you.

01:44:31.348 --> 01:44:34.477
Anakin, all I want is your love.

01:44:34.560 --> 01:44:36.937
Love won't save you, Padmé.

01:44:37.021 --> 01:44:40.274
- Only my new powers can do that.
- At what cost?

01:44:40.357 --> 01:44:42.777
You're a good person. Don't do this.

01:44:42.860 --> 01:44:45.613
I won't lose you
the way I lost my mother.

01:44:45.696 --> 01:44:49.950
I am becoming more powerful
than any jedi has ever dreamed of.

01:44:50.034 --> 01:44:52.870
And I'm doing it for you.
To protect you.

01:44:54.663 --> 01:44:56.123
Come away with me.

01:44:56.207 --> 01:44:58.918
Help me raise our child.

01:44:59.001 --> 01:45:01.796
Leave everything else behind
while we still can.

01:45:01.879 --> 01:45:03.255
Don't you see?

01:45:03.339 --> 01:45:06.592
We don't have to run away anymore.

01:45:06.675 --> 01:45:09.220
I have brought peace to the republic.

01:45:09.303 --> 01:45:12.181
I am more powerful than the chancellor.

01:45:12.264 --> 01:45:14.391
I can overthrow him.

01:45:16.435 --> 01:45:19.522
And together,
you and I can rule the galaxy,

01:45:19.605 --> 01:45:22.066
make things the way we want them to be.

01:45:28.364 --> 01:45:30.407
I don't believe what I'm hearing.

01:45:31.867 --> 01:45:35.204
Obi-Wan was right. You've changed.

01:45:37.373 --> 01:45:40.251
I don't want to hear any more
about Obi-Wan.

01:45:40.334 --> 01:45:44.547
The jedi turned against me.
Don't you turn against me.

01:45:46.215 --> 01:45:48.259
I don't know you anymore.

01:45:49.844 --> 01:45:51.846
Anakin,

01:45:51.929 --> 01:45:54.515
you're breaking my heart.

01:45:54.598 --> 01:45:57.601
You're going down a path I can't follow.

01:45:58.644 --> 01:46:00.479
Because of Obi-Wan?

01:46:00.563 --> 01:46:03.357
Because of what you've done.

01:46:03.440 --> 01:46:05.401
What you plan to do.

01:46:06.610 --> 01:46:09.238
Stop. Stop now. Come back.

01:46:09.321 --> 01:46:12.241
- I love you.
- Liar!

01:46:12.324 --> 01:46:13.325
(Gasps)

01:46:17.121 --> 01:46:20.875
You're with him!
You brought him here to kill me.

01:46:20.958 --> 01:46:23.961
- No.
- Let her go, Anakin.

01:46:25.462 --> 01:46:27.047
Anakin.

01:46:27.131 --> 01:46:29.341
Let her go.

01:46:30.509 --> 01:46:32.386
(Gasps)

01:46:39.310 --> 01:46:41.353
You turned her against me!

01:46:42.938 --> 01:46:45.149
You have done that yourself.

01:46:49.862 --> 01:46:52.072
You will not take her from me!

01:46:52.156 --> 01:46:56.035
Your anger and your lust for power
have already done that.

01:46:59.163 --> 01:47:04.335
You have allowed this dark lord
to twist your mind, until now...

01:47:05.878 --> 01:47:09.089
Until now you have become
the very thing you swore to destroy.

01:47:09.173 --> 01:47:11.091
Don't lecture me, Obi-Wan.

01:47:11.175 --> 01:47:13.719
I see through the lies of the jedi.

01:47:14.803 --> 01:47:17.222
I do not fear the dark side as you do.

01:47:19.016 --> 01:47:20.976
I have brought peace,

01:47:21.060 --> 01:47:22.770
freedom, justice

01:47:22.853 --> 01:47:26.732
and security to my new empire.

01:47:26.815 --> 01:47:29.693
Your new empire?

01:47:29.777 --> 01:47:33.113
Don't make me kill you.

01:47:33.197 --> 01:47:37.743
Anakin, my allegiance
is to the republic, to democracy!

01:47:37.826 --> 01:47:40.454
Anakin: If you're not with me,

01:47:41.455 --> 01:47:43.374
then you're my enemy.

01:47:45.376 --> 01:47:47.878
Only a sith deals in absolutes.

01:47:50.464 --> 01:47:51.924
I will do what I must.

01:47:52.967 --> 01:47:55.386
Anakin: You will try.

01:47:56.845 --> 01:47:58.931
(Shouts)

01:47:59.014 --> 01:48:01.392
(Both grunting)

01:48:16.573 --> 01:48:17.741
(Grunts)

01:48:27.126 --> 01:48:31.171
I hear a new apprentice
you have, emperor.

01:48:31.255 --> 01:48:35.759
Or should I call you darth Sidious?

01:48:35.843 --> 01:48:38.095
Master Yoda.

01:48:38.178 --> 01:48:40.264
You survived.

01:48:40.347 --> 01:48:43.100
Surprised?

01:48:43.183 --> 01:48:47.813
Your arrogance blinds you, master Yoda.

01:48:47.896 --> 01:48:49.982
Now you will experience

01:48:50.065 --> 01:48:54.570
the full power of the dark side.

01:49:32.316 --> 01:49:35.319
(Cackling)

01:49:36.487 --> 01:49:40.199
I have waited a long time

01:49:40.282 --> 01:49:42.868
for this moment,

01:49:42.951 --> 01:49:47.498
my little green friend.

01:49:48.999 --> 01:49:52.544
(Cackling)

01:49:53.545 --> 01:49:56.423
(Cackling continues)

01:49:56.507 --> 01:50:01.178
- (Grunts)
- At last the jedi are no more.

01:50:01.261 --> 01:50:05.516
Not if anything to say about it I have.

01:50:05.599 --> 01:50:06.975
Aaah!

01:50:10.104 --> 01:50:13.190
At an end your rule is.

01:50:14.858 --> 01:50:17.277
And not short enough it was.

01:50:17.361 --> 01:50:18.362
(Grunts)

01:50:20.364 --> 01:50:21.365
(Gasps)

01:50:22.282 --> 01:50:24.493
If so powerful you are,

01:50:25.702 --> 01:50:26.995
why leave?

01:50:28.122 --> 01:50:30.707
You will not stop me.

01:50:30.791 --> 01:50:35.420
Darth Vader will become
more powerful than either of us.

01:50:35.504 --> 01:50:39.883
Faith in your new apprentice
misplaced may be.

01:50:41.176 --> 01:50:45.264
As is your faith
in the dark side of the force.

01:50:56.066 --> 01:50:58.902
- (Cackling)
- (Grunts)

01:51:01.405 --> 01:51:02.406
(Choking)

01:51:02.656 --> 01:51:05.159
(Groaning)

01:51:07.494 --> 01:51:09.079
(Mouthing)

01:51:18.630 --> 01:51:20.424
- (Grunts)
- (Groans)

01:51:46.909 --> 01:51:48.952
(Grunting)

01:51:54.208 --> 01:51:55.751
(Shouts)

01:52:09.056 --> 01:52:11.642
(Grunting)

01:52:19.816 --> 01:52:23.654
- (Electronic twittering)
- (Alarm beeping)

01:52:23.737 --> 01:52:27.491
(Alarm blaring)

01:52:41.713 --> 01:52:43.131
(O roans)

01:52:45.884 --> 01:52:47.636
(Cackling)

01:52:55.018 --> 01:52:57.104
(Cackles)

01:53:16.832 --> 01:53:18.667
(Cackling)

01:53:29.386 --> 01:53:30.679
(Crash)

01:53:47.237 --> 01:53:49.906
(Grunting)

01:53:49.990 --> 01:53:52.159
(Cackling)

01:53:52.242 --> 01:53:54.953
(Groaning)

01:54:01.918 --> 01:54:02.919
(Grunts)

01:54:12.429 --> 01:54:15.390
(Palpatine cackling)

01:54:16.433 --> 01:54:18.894
(Groaning)

01:54:40.665 --> 01:54:43.085
(Beeping)

01:55:03.980 --> 01:55:06.024
(Grunts)

01:55:07.025 --> 01:55:09.194
(Panting)

01:55:12.864 --> 01:55:15.617
Hurry. Careful timing we will need.

01:55:15.700 --> 01:55:18.537
Activate your homing beacon
when you're ready.

01:55:18.620 --> 01:55:20.997
There's no sign of his body, sir.

01:55:21.081 --> 01:55:24.751
Then he is not dead. Double your search.

01:55:24.835 --> 01:55:27.087
Yes, sir. Right away, sir.

01:55:27.754 --> 01:55:32.300
Tell captain kagi to prepare my shuttle
for immediate takeoff.

01:55:32.384 --> 01:55:33.927
Yes, master.

01:55:34.010 --> 01:55:37.514
I sense lord vader is in danger.

01:56:27.898 --> 01:56:29.900
(Panting)

01:56:33.028 --> 01:56:34.988
(Beeps)

01:56:35.071 --> 01:56:37.073
(Hatch opens)

01:56:46.291 --> 01:56:50.086
Into exile I must go.

01:56:50.170 --> 01:56:52.297
Failed I have.

01:57:23.370 --> 01:57:25.121
(Grunts)

01:58:25.682 --> 01:58:27.684
(Panting)

01:58:31.688 --> 01:58:33.648
I have failed you, Anakin.

01:58:33.732 --> 01:58:35.650
I have failed you.

01:58:35.734 --> 01:58:38.653
I should have known the jedi
were plotting to take over.

01:58:38.737 --> 01:58:41.573
Anakin, chancellor palpatine is evil!

01:58:41.656 --> 01:58:44.326
From my point of view,
the jedi are evil.

01:58:44.409 --> 01:58:46.036
Well, then you are lost!

01:58:48.038 --> 01:58:50.040
(Droid whistles)

01:58:57.881 --> 01:59:00.425
This is the end for you, my master.

01:59:24.908 --> 01:59:29.079
It's over, Anakin.
I have the high ground.

01:59:30.705 --> 01:59:33.416
You underestimate my power.

01:59:34.751 --> 01:59:35.919
Don't try it.

01:59:37.545 --> 01:59:38.880
(Shouts)

01:59:40.590 --> 01:59:43.843
(Groaning)

01:59:43.927 --> 01:59:46.429
(Anakin continues groaning)

01:59:51.393 --> 01:59:53.895
(Anakin shouting)

01:59:58.858 --> 02:00:00.777
You were the chosen one!

02:00:02.237 --> 02:00:05.699
It was said that you would
destroy the sith, notjoin them!

02:00:08.076 --> 02:00:10.161
Bring balance to the force,

02:00:10.245 --> 02:00:12.789
not leave it in darkness!

02:00:12.872 --> 02:00:16.501
(Continues groaning)

02:00:23.550 --> 02:00:25.510
I hate you!

02:00:33.476 --> 02:00:35.645
You were my brother, Anakin.

02:00:37.647 --> 02:00:40.024
I loved you.

02:00:43.069 --> 02:00:45.071
(Screaming)

02:00:45.155 --> 02:00:48.324
(Screaming)

02:00:57.500 --> 02:01:00.378
(Anakin groaning)

02:01:00.462 --> 02:01:03.131
(Screaming)

02:01:05.550 --> 02:01:07.552
(Anakin groaning)

02:01:17.020 --> 02:01:19.773
(Whistles, beeps)

02:01:19.856 --> 02:01:21.858
Oh. Master Kenobi.

02:01:21.941 --> 02:01:24.235
Um, we have miss Padmé on board.

02:01:24.319 --> 02:01:26.863
Yes. Please, please hurry.

02:01:26.946 --> 02:01:29.157
We should leave this dreadful place.

02:01:41.169 --> 02:01:43.171
Obi-Wan.

02:01:44.672 --> 02:01:46.883
Is Anakin all right?

02:02:00.605 --> 02:02:03.066
(Whistles softly)

02:02:22.085 --> 02:02:25.505
(Moaning softly)

02:02:29.592 --> 02:02:31.970
(Groaning)

02:02:55.451 --> 02:02:58.288
Man: Your majesty, this way.

02:02:58.371 --> 02:03:00.290
There he is.

02:03:00.373 --> 02:03:02.584
He's still alive.

02:03:05.545 --> 02:03:07.797
Get a medical capsule immediately.

02:03:07.881 --> 02:03:09.883
Yes, sir. Right away.

02:03:16.556 --> 02:03:18.558
(Moaning softly)

02:03:46.169 --> 02:03:47.795
Excuse me, master Yoda.

02:03:53.676 --> 02:03:55.887
Obi-Wan Kenobi has made contact.

02:04:12.695 --> 02:04:15.156
We'll take her to the medical center.
Quickly.

02:04:19.160 --> 02:04:21.079
(Thunderclap)

02:04:44.686 --> 02:04:47.689
Medically, she's completely healthy.

02:04:47.772 --> 02:04:51.025
For reasons we can't explain,
we are losing her.

02:04:52.360 --> 02:04:55.113
- She's dying?
- We don't know why.

02:04:55.196 --> 02:04:57.281
She has lost the will to live.

02:04:57.365 --> 02:05:00.535
We need to operate quickly
if we are to save the babies.

02:05:00.618 --> 02:05:02.245
Babies?

02:05:02.328 --> 02:05:04.247
She's carrying twins.

02:05:20.555 --> 02:05:23.307
(H eartbeat thumping)

02:05:28.896 --> 02:05:31.607
(Screaming)

02:05:37.405 --> 02:05:39.574
(Whimpering, sobbing)

02:05:39.657 --> 02:05:42.285
(Baby crying)

02:05:43.828 --> 02:05:46.289
(Speaking alien language)

02:05:46.372 --> 02:05:49.167
- Luke.
- (Baby cooing)

02:05:56.049 --> 02:05:59.635
- Oh, Luke.
- (Cooing)

02:06:01.012 --> 02:06:03.056
(Padme whimpers)

02:06:03.139 --> 02:06:06.309
(Comforting in alien language)

02:06:07.518 --> 02:06:10.938
(Breathing erratically)

02:06:11.022 --> 02:06:13.691
(Shouting)

02:06:13.775 --> 02:06:16.861
(Baby crying)

02:06:16.944 --> 02:06:19.906
(Speaking alien language)

02:06:19.989 --> 02:06:22.950
- Obi-Wan: It's a girl.
- Leia.

02:06:23.034 --> 02:06:26.329
(H eartbeat thumping)

02:06:34.754 --> 02:06:37.507
(Beeping)

02:06:43.638 --> 02:06:45.640
(Wheezing)

02:06:53.689 --> 02:06:56.609
- (Soft thud)
- (Hiss)

02:06:56.692 --> 02:07:01.531
(Mechanical breathing)

02:07:04.909 --> 02:07:06.327
Obi-Wan?

02:07:07.662 --> 02:07:10.706
(Breathing heavily)

02:07:11.791 --> 02:07:13.709
There's good in him.

02:07:16.379 --> 02:07:18.339
I know.

02:07:18.422 --> 02:07:21.050
I know there's...

02:07:21.134 --> 02:07:23.136
Still...

02:07:29.559 --> 02:07:32.436
(Coos)

02:07:32.520 --> 02:07:34.730
(Crying)

02:07:38.025 --> 02:07:40.778
(Steam hisses)

02:07:46.284 --> 02:07:48.786
(Mechanical breathing)

02:07:52.540 --> 02:07:54.542
(Thud)

02:07:57.295 --> 02:08:00.006
- Lord vader.
- (Mechanical breathing)

02:08:00.089 --> 02:08:02.216
Can you hear me?

02:08:02.300 --> 02:08:05.178
(Mechanical breathing continues)

02:08:05.261 --> 02:08:07.763
(In deep voice) Yes, master.

02:08:09.849 --> 02:08:12.685
Where is Padmé?

02:08:12.768 --> 02:08:15.479
Is she safe?

02:08:16.564 --> 02:08:18.608
Is she all right?

02:08:20.276 --> 02:08:24.864
It seems, in your anger, you killed her.

02:08:25.865 --> 02:08:28.784
I? I couldn't have.

02:08:28.868 --> 02:08:31.913
She was alive. I felt it!

02:08:33.623 --> 02:08:37.001
(Darth Vader moaning)

02:08:47.220 --> 02:08:49.513
(Groaning)

02:09:05.821 --> 02:09:09.617
Hidden, safe the children must be kept.

02:09:11.244 --> 02:09:14.830
We must take them somewhere where
the sith will not sense their presence.

02:09:15.915 --> 02:09:19.877
Hmm. Split up they should be.

02:09:19.961 --> 02:09:22.129
My wife and I will take the girl.

02:09:23.673 --> 02:09:27.009
We've always talked
of adopting a baby girl.

02:09:27.093 --> 02:09:28.970
She will be loved with us.

02:09:30.221 --> 02:09:31.847
And what of the boy?

02:09:32.848 --> 02:09:36.310
To Tatooine. To his family send him.

02:09:38.104 --> 02:09:40.564
I will take the child
and watch over him.

02:09:46.028 --> 02:09:49.699
Until the time is right,
disappear we will.

02:09:51.492 --> 02:09:55.121
Master Kenobi, wait a moment.

02:09:56.622 --> 02:10:01.877
In your solitude on Tatooine,
training I have for you.

02:10:03.254 --> 02:10:04.505
Training?

02:10:04.588 --> 02:10:09.218
An old friend has learned
the path to immortality.

02:10:11.220 --> 02:10:14.348
One who has returned
from the nethenrvorld of the force.

02:10:14.432 --> 02:10:16.976
Your old master.

02:10:17.059 --> 02:10:19.061
Qui-gon?

02:10:21.564 --> 02:10:24.859
How to commune with him
I will teach you.

02:10:26.319 --> 02:10:28.487
- Captain antilles.
- Yes, your highness?

02:10:28.571 --> 02:10:30.489
I'm placing these droids in your care.

02:10:30.573 --> 02:10:32.491
Treat them well. Clean them up.

02:10:32.575 --> 02:10:34.493
Have the protocol droid's mind wiped.

02:10:34.577 --> 02:10:37.830
- What?
- (Beeps)

02:10:37.913 --> 02:10:39.915
Oh, no.

02:11:30.800 --> 02:11:34.303
(Mechanical breathing)

02:12:54.091 --> 02:12:56.093
(Bleats)

02:12:59.221 --> 02:13:01.223
(Snorts)
